(212098, 12189, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good shot for the challenge.  The angle you shot at really makes you "feel" the steepness of the steps.  8</td>', 'Good shot for the challenge.  The angle you shot at really makes you "feel" the steepness of the steps.  8', '2003-02-10 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(212103, 12159, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and fits the challenge well ! = 10</td>', 'Beautiful and fits the challenge well ! = 10', '2003-02-10 11:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(212107, 12101, 92, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo and the frame choice. The b/w choice is wonderful !  It looks like the girl on the far right has to tinkle :) That just makes this photo so cute ! = 10</td>', 'I really love this photo and the frame choice. The b/w choice is wonderful !  It looks like the girl on the far right has to tinkle :) That just makes this photo so cute ! = 10', '2003-02-10 11:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(212110, 12146, 92, '<td valign="top">The color tones are wonderful ! The tunnel being in thirds makes for a perfect photo. Your lighting is great. This is well done and meets the challenge well. = 10</td>', 'The color tones are wonderful ! The tunnel being in thirds makes for a perfect photo. Your lighting is great. This is well done and meets the challenge well. = 10', '2003-02-10 11:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(212111, 12306, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly strong perspective shot.. the black and white forces the viewer to look at the shapes and lines... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is an incredibly strong perspective shot.. the black and white forces the viewer to look at the shapes and lines... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-02-10 11:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(212113, 12243, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot!  I love railroad shots and this is a good one.. the snow really creates nice contrast in this image... i don''t think it would be anything close to this without that element... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot!  I love railroad shots and this is a good one.. the snow really creates nice contrast in this image... i don''t think it would be anything close to this without that element... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-02-10 11:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(212114, 12126, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great perspective shot... the contrast and the lines/shapes really make this one punch.  The slight motion blur on one of the elevators adds a nice element :) - 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great perspective shot... the contrast and the lines/shapes really make this one punch.  The slight motion blur on one of the elevators adds a nice element :) - 10 - setzler', '2003-02-10 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(212117, 12302, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great landscape shot.. I really love the color saturation in this image.  I don'' think that ''perspective'' plays a really large role here, but it''s a great photo none-the-less... = 9 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great landscape shot.. I really love the color saturation in this image.  I don'' think that ''perspective'' plays a really large role here, but it''s a great photo none-the-less... = 9 - setzler', '2003-02-10 11:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(212123, 12238, 92, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast in this. The soft lines just draw you in. Nicely done !</td>', 'I really like the contrast in this. The soft lines just draw you in. Nicely done !', '2003-02-10 11:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(212181, 12126, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great lines - good shot for the challenge.  I like the b/w - it really highlights the strong diagonal.  9</td>', 'Great lines - good shot for the challenge.  I like the b/w - it really highlights the strong diagonal.  9', '2003-02-10 12:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(212182, 12223, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color - nice exposure of a tricky subject.  8</td>', 'Beautiful color - nice exposure of a tricky subject.  8', '2003-02-10 12:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(212183, 12302, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting scene, could have been framed involving a little less sky.</td>', 'Nice contrasting scene, could have been framed involving a little less sky.', '2003-02-10 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(212185, 12260, 5391, '<td valign="top">The colors are excellent and the bolts laying about really add something ''different'' to the shot of tracks that we see so often.  Nice work.  8</td>', 'The colors are excellent and the bolts laying about really add something ''different'' to the shot of tracks that we see so often.  Nice work.  8', '2003-02-10 12:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(212190, 12139, 5391, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color.  A nice abstract shot that fits this challenge well.  8</td>', 'Gorgeous color.  A nice abstract shot that fits this challenge well.  8', '2003-02-10 12:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(212192, 12307, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  I have one of these Galileo thermometers and have tried repeatedly to capture it this well (with little luck).  Fits nice with the challenge, too.  9</td>', 'Excellent work.  I have one of these Galileo thermometers and have tried repeatedly to capture it this well (with little luck).  Fits nice with the challenge, too.  9', '2003-02-10 12:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(212201, 12176, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good rendering of contrasting volumes, nice shot</td>', 'Good rendering of contrasting volumes, nice shot', '2003-02-10 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(212221, 12290, 5391, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Best shot I''ve seen so far.  Amazing saturated colors and great lines.  Fine work.  10</td>', 'Awesome.  Best shot I''ve seen so far.  Amazing saturated colors and great lines.  Fine work.  10', '2003-02-10 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(212250, 12299, 4055, '<td valign="top">My absolute favourite this week and one of the best for weeks. Great composition. Perfect in b&amp;w. Marvelous sky. Good focus and contrast. Hope you win. Good Luck!</td>', 'My absolute favourite this week and one of the best for weeks. Great composition. Perfect in b&w. Marvelous sky. Good focus and contrast. Hope you win. Good Luck!', '2003-02-10 13:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(212264, 12118, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perhaps the ground in the lower right corner is a little disturbing. I love b&amp;w and this sepia tone is very good. Contrast and focus is good too. Overall a great job and I wish you good luck!</td>', 'One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perhaps the ground in the lower right corner is a little disturbing. I love b&w and this sepia tone is very good. Contrast and focus is good too. Overall a great job and I wish you good luck!', '2003-02-10 13:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(212266, 12201, 4055, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition. Good focus and contrast. Perfect in b&amp;w. High score from me.</td>', 'This is a great composition. Good focus and contrast. Perfect in b&w. High score from me.', '2003-02-10 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(212269, 12238, 4055, '<td valign="top">I think this composition is very good. Perhaps I would have liked to see the right part of the stairs too. But it is not THAT important. Great focus, contrast and perfect in b&amp;w. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'I think this composition is very good. Perhaps I would have liked to see the right part of the stairs too. But it is not THAT important. Great focus, contrast and perfect in b&w. Well done and good luck!', '2003-02-10 13:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(212275, 12101, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like almost everything about this shot. Great composition and focus. Perfect in b&amp;w. Just one thing: I think a b&amp;w shot should have a white or black (or both) border not this colour. Just a detail. Overall a great job that gets high score from me. Good luck!</td>', 'I like almost everything about this shot. Great composition and focus. Perfect in b&w. Just one thing: I think a b&w shot should have a white or black (or both) border not this colour. Just a detail. Overall a great job that gets high score from me. Good luck!', '2003-02-10 13:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(212294, 12130, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting lens flare effect around the head (huge corona). The bug must wonder "Is this our God?".</td>', 'Interesting lens flare effect around the head (huge corona). The bug must wonder "Is this our God?".', '2003-02-10 14:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(212296, 12268, 326, '<td valign="top">Very very nice!</td>', 'Very very nice!', '2003-02-10 14:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(212344, 12292, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge, lighting could do with improvement though , overall yellowish cast and dim lighitng detract from a potentially strong image.  The background clutter doesn''t add much either, other than disatractions</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge, lighting could do with improvement though , overall yellowish cast and dim lighitng detract from a potentially strong image.  The background clutter doesn''t add much either, other than disatractions', '2003-02-10 14:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(212346, 12248, 656, '<td valign="top">wow - a huge opportunity.  Personally I''d love to see this with nothing other than the green grass and grave stones - it would really be an arresting pattern/ texture shot them.  I feel that the trees/ sky/ monument are really distracitions from the main message and main impact of this wonderful scene.  The fact that it represents so many deaths also has a huge impact.   If you can, I''d love to see this with the patterns really worked on</td>', 'wow - a huge opportunity.  Personally I''d love to see this with nothing other than the green grass and grave stones - it would really be an arresting pattern/ texture shot them.  I feel that the trees/ sky/ monument are really distracitions from the main message and main impact of this wonderful scene.  The fact that it represents so many deaths also has a huge impact.   If you can, I''d love to see this with the patterns really worked on', '2003-02-10 14:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(212349, 12130, 656, '<td valign="top">lens flare saves this from being dull - I realise it would be hard, but more of a lean/ angle would have filled the frame better and left the head less centered</td>', 'lens flare saves this from being dull - I realise it would be hard, but more of a lean/ angle would have filled the frame better and left the head less centered', '2003-02-10 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(212357, 12235, 656, '<td valign="top">love the tone - wish you could have spot edited the damage up the left column.  The rear column seems blocked somehow - would have liked to see this slightly round to the left to break the three columns up- the two triangles at the top don''t quite seem to be balanced with the other shapes and lines in the composition</td>', 'love the tone - wish you could have spot edited the damage up the left column.  The rear column seems blocked somehow - would have liked to see this slightly round to the left to break the three columns up- the two triangles at the top don''t quite seem to be balanced with the other shapes and lines in the composition', '2003-02-10 14:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(212358, 12278, 656, '<td valign="top">prize for the best use of a cheese grater here.  Weird and effective, although the one white/ hotspot lets this down - and it is bang in a focal point, at the chin of the mask - where all the lines lead to.  high marks for originality</td>', 'prize for the best use of a cheese grater here.  Weird and effective, although the one white/ hotspot lets this down - and it is bang in a focal point, at the chin of the mask - where all the lines lead to.  high marks for originality', '2003-02-10 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(212360, 12248, 6182, '<td valign="top">I really love this concept and the execution is pretty exceptional.  Upon taking a closer look, I think it might have been better without the tree hanging down at the top...I may have cropped a bit tighter on top.  I also think I would have tried for a time when the shadow was on the other side of the tree   It''s still one of my favorite shots for this challenge.</td>', 'I really love this concept and the execution is pretty exceptional.  Upon taking a closer look, I think it might have been better without the tree hanging down at the top...I may have cropped a bit tighter on top.  I also think I would have tried for a time when the shadow was on the other side of the tree   It''s still one of my favorite shots for this challenge.', '2003-02-10 14:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(212361, 12231, 656, '<td valign="top">Strongly graphic, I wish the trees were not there.  The whisp of cloud, the blue sky and the red pillar would have been great, alone.  The trees bring it back to reality and restore the sense of scale, which I don''t know that this needs, though normally it is a good (albeit a bit cliched) way to fill in some boring sky.</td>', 'Strongly graphic, I wish the trees were not there.  The whisp of cloud, the blue sky and the red pillar would have been great, alone.  The trees bring it back to reality and restore the sense of scale, which I don''t know that this needs, though normally it is a good (albeit a bit cliched) way to fill in some boring sky.', '2003-02-10 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(212362, 12307, 656, '<td valign="top">Funky macro of a Galileo thermometer.  Some of the highlights seem a bit blown but an interesting shot all the same</td>', 'Funky macro of a Galileo thermometer.  Some of the highlights seem a bit blown but an interesting shot all the same', '2003-02-10 14:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(212363, 12223, 656, '<td valign="top">I''d have loved to have seen more of the tree branches, spreading out towards the edges of the scene.  As it is, they seem somewhat clipped/ chopped off</td>', 'I''d have loved to have seen more of the tree branches, spreading out towards the edges of the scene.  As it is, they seem somewhat clipped/ chopped off', '2003-02-10 14:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(212365, 12263, 656, '<td valign="top">A fine shot, and the graphic structure of the arch/ window is mirrored well in her face/ hair.  The tree complicates and detracts a bit from this symmetry though.    Has potential</td>', 'A fine shot, and the graphic structure of the arch/ window is mirrored well in her face/ hair.  The tree complicates and detracts a bit from this symmetry though.    Has potential', '2003-02-10 14:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(212366, 12271, 656, '<td valign="top">Great!  well exposed, very sharp - love it</td>', 'Great!  well exposed, very sharp - love it', '2003-02-10 14:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(212367, 12118, 656, '<td valign="top">great use of pattern and repetition.  The lines drag me along into the picture - needs a boat at the focal point though, or ''something''</td>', 'great use of pattern and repetition.  The lines drag me along into the picture - needs a boat at the focal point though, or ''something''', '2003-02-10 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(212368, 12243, 656, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see this without the sky included at all, with just a slightly sharper camera angle</td>', 'I''d have liked to see this without the sky included at all, with just a slightly sharper camera angle', '2003-02-10 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(212369, 12178, 656, '<td valign="top">I think a slightly more titled camera, to lose the sky completely woul be stronger - the light patch in the upper left particularly pulls my eye out of the cut valley</td>', 'I think a slightly more titled camera, to lose the sky completely woul be stronger - the light patch in the upper left particularly pulls my eye out of the cut valley', '2003-02-10 15:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(212370, 12216, 656, '<td valign="top">A harp ?   Doesn''t really feel sharp anywhere across the whole plane, but interesting</td>', 'A harp ?   Doesn''t really feel sharp anywhere across the whole plane, but interesting', '2003-02-10 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(212372, 12101, 656, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2003-02-10 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(212373, 12109, 656, '<td valign="top">wow.  she looks like a homeless person.</td>', 'wow.  she looks like a homeless person.', '2003-02-10 15:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(212376, 12214, 656, '<td valign="top">The light triangle on the left seems out of place with this scene</td>', 'The light triangle on the left seems out of place with this scene', '2003-02-10 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(212378, 12174, 656, '<td valign="top">The tree breaks up the pattern/ texture of this shot - I''d like to see it without that I think</td>', 'The tree breaks up the pattern/ texture of this shot - I''d like to see it without that I think', '2003-02-10 15:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(212381, 12143, 656, '<td valign="top">might work better as B&amp;W as the colours aren''t adding anything.</td>', 'might work better as B&W as the colours aren''t adding anything.', '2003-02-10 15:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(212384, 12285, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow!  it really does seem to be coming out of the screen!  3D effects for free.  Excellent - love the focus on the eyes and leaving the snout out of focus.  Simply great.</td>', 'Wow!  it really does seem to be coming out of the screen!  3D effects for free.  Excellent - love the focus on the eyes and leaving the snout out of focus.  Simply great.', '2003-02-10 15:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(212393, 12159, 772, '<td valign="top">very well executed shot... the strong diagonal of the stem works well here.. the color contrast is also excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'very well executed shot... the strong diagonal of the stem works well here.. the color contrast is also excellent :) - setzler', '2003-02-10 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(212555, 12176, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice perspective work on this shot :)  The contrast is also excellent... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice perspective work on this shot :)  The contrast is also excellent... good work :) - setzler', '2003-02-10 16:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(212570, 12243, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is one of those rare instances where I think tilting the camera adds to the shot... that made it much more interesting... good eye!</td>', 'This is one of those rare instances where I think tilting the camera adds to the shot... that made it much more interesting... good eye!', '2003-02-10 16:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(212577, 12290, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely powerful composition and the colors are wonderful!</td>', 'This is an extremely powerful composition and the colors are wonderful!', '2003-02-10 16:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(212582, 12238, 656, '<td valign="top">I like this , but I think the design elements would be stronger if the right hand rail hadn''t been amputated.   Then you''d have 3 elegant curves, the left rail, the carpet/ stairs and the right wal/ railing, all working in harmony to lead you through the scene.   The tonal range is okay, the lighting is interesting, but that interuption bothers me and my eye.  If those elements were more in harmony this would be a much stronger, very graphical design.   What would be 3 major tonal areas are also divided up into 5, with triangles in the lower right and upper right that are competing not harmonising with the scene.  The steps give just enough interest and tonal range to stop this eing boring.  A good effort but needs some thought on the composition and the visual weight of shapes and relationships.</td>', 'I like this , but I think the design elements would be stronger if the right hand rail hadn''t been amputated.   Then you''d have 3 elegant curves, the left rail, the carpet/ stairs and the right wal/ railing, all working in harmony to lead you through the scene.   The tonal range is okay, the lighting is interesting, but that interuption bothers me and my eye.  If those elements were more in harmony this would be a much stronger, very graphical design.   What would be 3 major tonal areas are also divided up into 5, with triangles in the lower right and upper right that are competing not harmonising with the scene.  The steps give just enough interest and tonal range to stop this eing boring.  A good effort but needs some thought on the composition and the visual weight of shapes and relationships.', '2003-02-10 16:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(212583, 12101, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot!  I hope the girl at the end on the right was able to make it to the potty in time :)</td>', 'Very cute shot!  I hope the girl at the end on the right was able to make it to the potty in time :)', '2003-02-10 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
