(213261, 12130, 4482, '<td valign="top">Me like. Very original subject. The focus and DOF are perfect. The colors are great. The sun does put me of  the subject though. 8</td>', 'Me like. Very original subject. The focus and DOF are perfect. The colors are great. The sun does put me of  the subject though. 8', '2003-02-11 07:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(213262, 12243, 4482, '<td valign="top">NOt and original subject for this challenge but the best one here due to the angle. Teh sepia tone works well here and the white patches of snow add to the perspective. Good job. 8</td>', 'NOt and original subject for this challenge but the best one here due to the angle. Teh sepia tone works well here and the white patches of snow add to the perspective. Good job. 8', '2003-02-11 08:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(213263, 12304, 4482, '<td valign="top">A couple of building shots this week but I like this one.It''s well cropped and centered (which works well for this pic). The cloud adds a lot to the pic breaking the otherwise mundane symetry. Crisp focus and DOF. 8</td>', 'A couple of building shots this week but I like this one.It''s well cropped and centered (which works well for this pic). The cloud adds a lot to the pic breaking the otherwise mundane symetry. Crisp focus and DOF. 8', '2003-02-11 08:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(213264, 12139, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great colors, DOF and focus! I don''t often like double colored borders but this one really works well with the thin blue line. 8</td>', 'Great colors, DOF and focus! I don''t often like double colored borders but this one really works well with the thin blue line. 8', '2003-02-11 08:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(213265, 12176, 4482, '<td valign="top">A builing shot and a tree shot combined. Good job! One of my tops of the week. great DOF and focis. The light sepia adds to the drama. The angle works really well here. 9</td>', 'A builing shot and a tree shot combined. Good job! One of my tops of the week. great DOF and focis. The light sepia adds to the drama. The angle works really well here. 9', '2003-02-11 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(213266, 12248, 4482, '<td valign="top">Of the cimetary shots, it''s the best executed one. it really does show perspective. The colors are sharp as well as the DOF and focus. The only thing that I find distracting is the tree on the right as it draws my attention away from the stones. 8</td>', 'Of the cimetary shots, it''s the best executed one. it really does show perspective. The colors are sharp as well as the DOF and focus. The only thing that I find distracting is the tree on the right as it draws my attention away from the stones. 8', '2003-02-11 08:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(213267, 12141, 4482, '<td valign="top">Very original photo for this challenge. Crisp focus and DOF. 8</td>', 'Very original photo for this challenge. Crisp focus and DOF. 8', '2003-02-11 08:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(213269, 12290, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOW! Whata  blue sky! I love the funky angle and it fits the challenge . crisp DOF! 8</td>', 'WOW! Whata  blue sky! I love the funky angle and it fits the challenge . crisp DOF! 8', '2003-02-11 08:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(213282, 12310, 5982, '<td valign="top">Original!  Would have like less grain the background but good shot!</td>', 'Original!  Would have like less grain the background but good shot!', '2003-02-11 08:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(213283, 12299, 5982, '<td valign="top">Nice old fashion shot!  LIke the mood!</td>', 'Nice old fashion shot!  LIke the mood!', '2003-02-11 08:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(213284, 12296, 5982, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, too bad it''s missing a little focus on the back, otherwise I love the shot</td>', 'Very nice image, too bad it''s missing a little focus on the back, otherwise I love the shot', '2003-02-11 08:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(213285, 12278, 5982, '<td valign="top">Scariest cheese grater I,ve seen!  Original!</td>', 'Scariest cheese grater I,ve seen!  Original!', '2003-02-11 08:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(213286, 12260, 5982, '<td valign="top">The picture is very good, I don''t like much the huge frame though but a very nice image!</td>', 'The picture is very good, I don''t like much the huge frame though but a very nice image!', '2003-02-11 09:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(213303, 12299, 1856, '<td valign="top">A little too much foreground imo...but great shot :)</td>', 'A little too much foreground imo...but great shot :)', '2003-02-11 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(213333, 12130, 2989, '<td valign="top">Taken at this perspective this guy looks to be at least 10 feet tall.  The subject is a bit boring, but an overall great photo!</td>', 'Taken at this perspective this guy looks to be at least 10 feet tall.  The subject is a bit boring, but an overall great photo!', '2003-02-11 10:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(213334, 12129, 2989, '<td valign="top">This shot is very interesting.  The center of the tower (the top) feels off center, but the contrast of blue and black makes for a great photograph. - xertion</td>', 'This shot is very interesting.  The center of the tower (the top) feels off center, but the contrast of blue and black makes for a great photograph. - xertion', '2003-02-11 10:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(213336, 12299, 2989, '<td valign="top">This almost has a surreal feel to it.  The desolation... it gives off a sad alone feeling.  The b &amp; w, noise, and perspective makes this a very unique interesting shot. - xertion</td>', 'This almost has a surreal feel to it.  The desolation... it gives off a sad alone feeling.  The b & w, noise, and perspective makes this a very unique interesting shot. - xertion', '2003-02-11 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(213338, 12146, 2989, '<td valign="top">Nice take on perspective, and I enjoy the burnt orange color, but I wish this tunnel were longer, creating an ever stronger feeling of perspective.</td>', 'Nice take on perspective, and I enjoy the burnt orange color, but I wish this tunnel were longer, creating an ever stronger feeling of perspective.', '2003-02-11 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(213341, 12143, 2989, '<td valign="top">The angle is great on this shot, and the subject is very interesting.  The colors are a bit dull, I would have adjusted the levels or contrast in a photo editing program.  Great shot. - xertion</td>', 'The angle is great on this shot, and the subject is very interesting.  The colors are a bit dull, I would have adjusted the levels or contrast in a photo editing program.  Great shot. - xertion', '2003-02-11 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(213345, 12204, 2989, '<td valign="top">This takes on a whole new look from this perspective.  Very bright vivid colors and interesting choice in flag position.  I assume you took a lot more than one shot, I think you made a good choice.</td>', 'This takes on a whole new look from this perspective.  Very bright vivid colors and interesting choice in flag position.  I assume you took a lot more than one shot, I think you made a good choice.', '2003-02-11 10:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(213349, 12290, 2989, '<td valign="top">The bright blue and very crisp edges adds a lot to this otherwise boring shot.  I can''t tell if this building was originally red or not, but your choice of colors really works well. - xertion</td>', 'The bright blue and very crisp edges adds a lot to this otherwise boring shot.  I can''t tell if this building was originally red or not, but your choice of colors really works well. - xertion', '2003-02-11 10:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(213352, 12176, 2989, '<td valign="top">The tree itself has an interesting perspective, but you managed to find 2 other subjects and include in an amazing photosgraph depicting the challenge.  The sun is distracting on the one building, the the colors and position are excellent. 10! - xertion</td>', 'The tree itself has an interesting perspective, but you managed to find 2 other subjects and include in an amazing photosgraph depicting the challenge.  The sun is distracting on the one building, the the colors and position are excellent. 10! - xertion', '2003-02-11 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(213377, 12061, 772, '<td valign="top">The reflections in this photo are interesting, but the theme of ''perspecitve'' seems a bit weak to me.. - setzler</td>', 'The reflections in this photo are interesting, but the theme of ''perspecitve'' seems a bit weak to me.. - setzler', '2003-02-11 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(213438, 12078, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape.  The river leads me right into this scene and flows very smoothly... The detail and depth of field are great... - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape.  The river leads me right into this scene and flows very smoothly... The detail and depth of field are great... - setzler', '2003-02-11 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(213446, 12230, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting old train :)  I hope you shot a lot of photos here... as for perspective, this particular image is a little ''flat'' and doesn''t seem to contain any features where the ''perspective'' creates impact... - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting old train :)  I hope you shot a lot of photos here... as for perspective, this particular image is a little ''flat'' and doesn''t seem to contain any features where the ''perspective'' creates impact... - setzler', '2003-02-11 12:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(213469, 12272, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice perspective and use of black and white.. .the repeating pattern here is quite eye catching :)  - good work... - setzler</td>', 'very nice perspective and use of black and white.. .the repeating pattern here is quite eye catching :)  - good work... - setzler', '2003-02-11 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(213507, 12301, 6097, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Great DOF.  I like the wintry, neutral colors.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Great DOF.  I like the wintry, neutral colors.', '2003-02-11 13:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(213519, 12159, 3102, '<td valign="top">Awesome details!  I like the way blue gradients between the top &amp; bottom, too.</td>', 'Awesome details!  I like the way blue gradients between the top & bottom, too.', '2003-02-11 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(213522, 12061, 3102, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too busy.  I''m afraid that the glare is too distracting.</td>', 'Just a bit too busy.  I''m afraid that the glare is too distracting.', '2003-02-11 13:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(213523, 12296, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looked very interesting as a thumbnail, but I think it would have been more effective had the whole image been focused, rather than just the foreground.  I like the angle.</td>', 'Looked very interesting as a thumbnail, but I think it would have been more effective had the whole image been focused, rather than just the foreground.  I like the angle.', '2003-02-11 13:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(213550, 12159, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very well done. 10</td>', 'Very well done. 10', '2003-02-11 14:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(213571, 12293, 5508, '<td valign="top">Being Canadian I would of liked it better if it was a Canadian Falg. Kidding :). The only little thing that I don''t like about this photo is the sky. I would have prefered blue. BUT! it''s at half mast I presume because of the terrible Columbia crash. So the grey suits this photo.  What I really love about it is the composition. WOW the flag looks like it''s waving forever. Great job. To my American cousin I will have to give you a 10.</td>', 'Being Canadian I would of liked it better if it was a Canadian Falg. Kidding :). The only little thing that I don''t like about this photo is the sky. I would have prefered blue. BUT! it''s at half mast I presume because of the terrible Columbia crash. So the grey suits this photo.  What I really love about it is the composition. WOW the flag looks like it''s waving forever. Great job. To my American cousin I will have to give you a 10.', '2003-02-11 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(213576, 12310, 5508, '<td valign="top">I like. Good imagination here people take notes. 9</td>', 'I like. Good imagination here people take notes. 9', '2003-02-11 14:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
