(213688, 12271, 2690, '<td valign="top">every time I come back to this picture...LOL I have raised it up. it is out of focus, maybe a little longer (f)stop...still the dog steals the shot! It has made it to (10) in 2 days....from a (5) good shot...retake it in a little more focus and you will have a great shot for the wall!</td>', 'every time I come back to this picture...LOL I have raised it up. it is out of focus, maybe a little longer (f)stop...still the dog steals the shot! It has made it to (10) in 2 days....from a (5) good shot...retake it in a little more focus and you will have a great shot for the wall!', '2003-02-11 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(213691, 12260, 2690, '<td valign="top">nice shot, old warn out subject though...still scores high with me. Hope you cleaned that track off when you were done shooting!...LOL</td>', 'nice shot, old warn out subject though...still scores high with me. Hope you cleaned that track off when you were done shooting!...LOL', '2003-02-11 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(213693, 12268, 2690, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. seems to have a little tilt in it mabe a few degrees to the clockwise would have helped this. colors are nice but a polorizing filter might have brought out the sky a little more. well done. high scores!</td>', 'very nice shot. seems to have a little tilt in it mabe a few degrees to the clockwise would have helped this. colors are nice but a polorizing filter might have brought out the sky a little more. well done. high scores!', '2003-02-11 16:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(213695, 12183, 2690, '<td valign="top">nice shot. well done. lighting is good cropping is good. subject is good.<br/>tell me...do you hang out at the state house a lot there in texas or is it just me?<br/> <br/>P.S. like the two donut eating troopers at the top skipping out on work!</td>', 'nice shot. well done. lighting is good cropping is good. subject is good.tell me...do you hang out at the state house a lot there in texas or is it just me? P.S. like the two donut eating troopers at the top skipping out on work!', '2003-02-11 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(213702, 12156, 2690, '<td valign="top">nice, but the bridge kind of overpowers the shot. Very contrasty<br/>still an ok photo..subject is a little overused for prespective..still<br/>a nice photo</td>', 'nice, but the bridge kind of overpowers the shot. Very contrastystill an ok photo..subject is a little overused for prespective..stilla nice photo', '2003-02-11 16:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(213704, 12159, 2690, '<td valign="top">Love the color and sharpness, very impressive. prespective is a little weak...but still a strong photo. When shooting prespective in macro...prespective needs to be exstream in order to see it... dont get me wrong...its a lovely shot...nice job<br/>it just IMO is not showing enough prespective...</td>', 'Love the color and sharpness, very impressive. prespective is a little weak...but still a strong photo. When shooting prespective in macro...prespective needs to be exstream in order to see it... dont get me wrong...its a lovely shot...nice jobit just IMO is not showing enough prespective...', '2003-02-11 16:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(213735, 12118, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful perspective shot... the reflections are excellent :)  I also like the toning... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful perspective shot... the reflections are excellent :)  I also like the toning... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-11 17:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
