(213849, 12101, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  I might have cropped out the last girl on the right along with the distracting background behind her.  The only thing I don''t like is the border.  I think it kind of detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Really nice shot.  I might have cropped out the last girl on the right along with the distracting background behind her.  The only thing I don''t like is the border.  I think it kind of detracts from the shot.', '2003-02-11 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
