(214294, 12084, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most beautiful photos I havae ever seen.  I would love to have a large one hanging on my wall.  This is unique and a very different shot of a city.  Beautiful photography, focus, cropping, depth.  I especially like how the sun shinges on the front of some buildings making them look outstanding and the rest look like they are just part of the city.  Hope you can understand.  This should be tops.</td>', 'This is one of the most beautiful photos I havae ever seen.  I would love to have a large one hanging on my wall.  This is unique and a very different shot of a city.  Beautiful photography, focus, cropping, depth.  I especially like how the sun shinges on the front of some buildings making them look outstanding and the rest look like they are just part of the city.  Hope you can understand.  This should be tops.', '2003-02-12 13:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(214295, 12076, 4648, '<td valign="top">This looks too much like the freedom photo.  You must shoot together.  I suggest you use different shots.  This is beautiful but is lessened by one so close to it..  It is seriously a beautiful work of art, but so is the other one.</td>', 'This looks too much like the freedom photo.  You must shoot together.  I suggest you use different shots.  This is beautiful but is lessened by one so close to it..  It is seriously a beautiful work of art, but so is the other one.', '2003-02-12 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(214297, 12204, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how many caught the freedom, even for the flag only hooked on one hook.  You and your friend must either stop shooting together or get together on who is going to use which shot.  It detracts from each others.  This is georgeous but not as outstanding as if woud be if it were the only one.</td>', 'I don''t know how many caught the freedom, even for the flag only hooked on one hook.  You and your friend must either stop shooting together or get together on who is going to use which shot.  It detracts from each others.  This is georgeous but not as outstanding as if woud be if it were the only one.', '2003-02-12 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(214298, 12307, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I can see nothing in this photo.  I don''t recognize anything and don''t know what it is a photo of.  I hope you explain what it is.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I can see nothing in this photo.  I don''t recognize anything and don''t know what it is a photo of.  I hope you explain what it is.', '2003-02-12 13:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(214299, 12263, 4648, '<td valign="top">The eaxpression is great but it is too dark on her.  To me the out of focus window really has no place in the photo.  She is the photo, in my opinion.  But the twig touching her forhead is very detracting and would be especially if your cropped the window out.  I still think she and her expression is your photo.</td>', 'The eaxpression is great but it is too dark on her.  To me the out of focus window really has no place in the photo.  She is the photo, in my opinion.  But the twig touching her forhead is very detracting and would be especially if your cropped the window out.  I still think she and her expression is your photo.', '2003-02-12 13:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(214300, 12289, 4648, '<td valign="top">At least you weren''t shooting with them.  Your pole has an eagle on top.  Is the white spot at the end of the flag the moon.  It is really distracting in the shot.  Otherwise it is a really nice shot.  The star area appears a little out of focus.</td>', 'At least you weren''t shooting with them.  Your pole has an eagle on top.  Is the white spot at the end of the flag the moon.  It is really distracting in the shot.  Otherwise it is a really nice shot.  The star area appears a little out of focus.', '2003-02-12 13:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(214301, 12108, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is plain, simple, and absolutely beautiful.  I can''t say enough good about this one.  I really like that there is only one star showing, and I know that wasn''t easy to do.  Beautiful cropping job.  The focus is fantastic and the colors are so true and natural.  This is number 1 in my book.</td>', 'This is plain, simple, and absolutely beautiful.  I can''t say enough good about this one.  I really like that there is only one star showing, and I know that wasn''t easy to do.  Beautiful cropping job.  The focus is fantastic and the colors are so true and natural.  This is number 1 in my book.', '2003-02-12 13:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(214303, 12289, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  I like the boldness of the flag against the blue sky.  Hope you don''t get criticized for having a patriotic shot!</td>', 'Nice work.  I like the boldness of the flag against the blue sky.  Hope you don''t get criticized for having a patriotic shot!', '2003-02-12 13:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(214304, 12302, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and wonderful composition.  I like how the cows help to give some idea how big the windmills really are.  Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and wonderful composition.  I like how the cows help to give some idea how big the windmills really are.  Nice work.', '2003-02-12 13:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(214305, 12240, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is so impactive.  Where in the world is this?  It speaks volumnes.  I would love to know the whole story of this.  Beautiful job of photography.  There''s nothing that can be said to help improve the shot.  It is fantastic as is.  Congrautlations.</td>', 'This is so impactive.  Where in the world is this?  It speaks volumnes.  I would love to know the whole story of this.  Beautiful job of photography.  There''s nothing that can be said to help improve the shot.  It is fantastic as is.  Congrautlations.', '2003-02-12 13:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(214307, 12254, 4648, '<td valign="top">I agree with the title, BUT where is a squirrel?  There needs to be one so that the title is not the only thing saying so.  The photo must be able to stand alone with the title and still reflect it.  Am I just overlooking the squirrel?    Trying to figure out your tone.  It''s not a black and white, nor is it a sepia tone.  What ever it is supposed to be it also needs to be lighter.  The composition is good and the focus is especially good, more on the soft side.  It just needs to be lighter.</td>', 'I agree with the title, BUT where is a squirrel?  There needs to be one so that the title is not the only thing saying so.  The photo must be able to stand alone with the title and still reflect it.  Am I just overlooking the squirrel?    Trying to figure out your tone.  It''s not a black and white, nor is it a sepia tone.  What ever it is supposed to be it also needs to be lighter.  The composition is good and the focus is especially good, more on the soft side.  It just needs to be lighter.', '2003-02-12 13:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(214309, 12293, 4648, '<td valign="top">How many of you went together to do the photography for this challenge.  This looks like the same pole in each one of them.  Or is it that patriotism is just on our minds more right now.  Of course I like this.  What I especially like is how it looks like a black and white with only the flag in color.  This is awesome.</td>', 'How many of you went together to do the photography for this challenge.  This looks like the same pole in each one of them.  Or is it that patriotism is just on our minds more right now.  Of course I like this.  What I especially like is how it looks like a black and white with only the flag in color.  This is awesome.', '2003-02-12 13:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(214314, 12287, 4648, '<td valign="top">The moon, I''m guessing it is that white spot on the right side near the bottom, looks almost un-natural.  The thing I like the most about this whole photo is the tree on the left that curves toward the right.  I wish it had been totally in focus.  Title this photo what you want, it is the bent tree.  That tree is awesome and makes the whole shot.</td>', 'The moon, I''m guessing it is that white spot on the right side near the bottom, looks almost un-natural.  The thing I like the most about this whole photo is the tree on the left that curves toward the right.  I wish it had been totally in focus.  Title this photo what you want, it is the bent tree.  That tree is awesome and makes the whole shot.', '2003-02-12 13:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
