(214373, 12244, 772, '<td valign="top">The perspective in this shot is strong, but the overall image is a little soft.. think a little extra sharpness would be a nice improvement :) - setzler</td>', 'The perspective in this shot is strong, but the overall image is a little soft.. think a little extra sharpness would be a nice improvement :) - setzler', '2003-02-12 16:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
