(214415, 12248, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph.  Three things I especially like - the way you took the photo down the lines, appearing to go on forever;  he shade of the big tree, giving the photo a touch of life rather than just beinging a photo;  and the focus and depth to the lines of graves.  The focus never stops and I think that adds so much to this, making the photo appear to go on to infinity with no end.  This is an excellent composition with really good execution.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph.  Three things I especially like - the way you took the photo down the lines, appearing to go on forever;  he shade of the big tree, giving the photo a touch of life rather than just beinging a photo;  and the focus and depth to the lines of graves.  The focus never stops and I think that adds so much to this, making the photo appear to go on to infinity with no end.  This is an excellent composition with really good execution.  Congratulations.', '2003-02-12 18:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(214416, 12130, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the sun in the top left corner, you can see the rays shotting out from it.  Maybe it''s my monitor, but the white round spot at about the pocket on the right side is a little distracting.  It was either a spot on your lens or on my monitor.  I love the angle of this shot, not flattering but different.  Sure fits the title.  Well done photo, nicely focused and well cropped.  Good shot.</td>', 'I love the sun in the top left corner, you can see the rays shotting out from it.  Maybe it''s my monitor, but the white round spot at about the pocket on the right side is a little distracting.  It was either a spot on your lens or on my monitor.  I love the angle of this shot, not flattering but different.  Sure fits the title.  Well done photo, nicely focused and well cropped.  Good shot.', '2003-02-12 18:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(214420, 12301, 4648, '<td valign="top">What strange icicles (?).  I love the reflection in the water.  Beautiful photo and so glad you didn''t crop out the landscape surrounding your subject.  The title isn''t necessary to point out what the subject of the photo is, unless to say what they look like to you.  It is very apparent what the subject is and the surroundings are jusr icing on top of the cake.  Very nice composition and well executed.  I love it.  Great job.  Very clear and beautiful photograph.</td>', 'What strange icicles (?).  I love the reflection in the water.  Beautiful photo and so glad you didn''t crop out the landscape surrounding your subject.  The title isn''t necessary to point out what the subject of the photo is, unless to say what they look like to you.  It is very apparent what the subject is and the surroundings are jusr icing on top of the cake.  Very nice composition and well executed.  I love it.  Great job.  Very clear and beautiful photograph.', '2003-02-12 18:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(214422, 12078, 4648, '<td valign="top">Postcard perfect.  Need I say anymore, besides I love it.  This is wonderful.  What is it like stretched including more on each side, for a picture to be hung above a couch.  Get any like that.  Would make a beautiful large couch one with two side ones of similar shots.  The quality is this good.</td>', 'Postcard perfect.  Need I say anymore, besides I love it.  This is wonderful.  What is it like stretched including more on each side, for a picture to be hung above a couch.  Get any like that.  Would make a beautiful large couch one with two side ones of similar shots.  The quality is this good.', '2003-02-12 18:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(214424, 12257, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this by any chance the same silo as in the "Silo" photo?  This is a good shot of how a silo is made.  The vines on the inside are a nice touch.  Nice clear photo.  I really like the focus and the angle of the shot.  Would have liked a little more on the right side.  Just a thought.  Nice photo, well done.</td>', 'Is this by any chance the same silo as in the "Silo" photo?  This is a good shot of how a silo is made.  The vines on the inside are a nice touch.  Nice clear photo.  I really like the focus and the angle of the shot.  Would have liked a little more on the right side.  Just a thought.  Nice photo, well done.', '2003-02-12 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(214426, 12223, 806, '<td valign="top">how pretty! nice angle, great contrasts. would like a bit more dof to see more detail in the foreground as well as the distant branches, but that''s a nit pick.</td>', 'how pretty! nice angle, great contrasts. would like a bit more dof to see more detail in the foreground as well as the distant branches, but that''s a nit pick.', '2003-02-12 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(214427, 12214, 806, '<td valign="top">nice patterns, and angle. a bit dark.. i know, i know..hence the title...<br/></td>', 'nice patterns, and angle. a bit dark.. i know, i know..hence the title...', '2003-02-12 18:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(214429, 12286, 4648, '<td valign="top">What''s "all in a day''s work", sleep.  I can deal with that.  This is a beautiful photo of a beautiful cat.  Her fur is so rich.  Complaint?  Would love to see more of her.  Meet the challenge?  Not to sure.  Good photo?  you bet.</td>', 'What''s "all in a day''s work", sleep.  I can deal with that.  This is a beautiful photo of a beautiful cat.  Her fur is so rich.  Complaint?  Would love to see more of her.  Meet the challenge?  Not to sure.  Good photo?  you bet.', '2003-02-12 18:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(214431, 12235, 806, '<td valign="top">neat. 3 columns make for a nice composition. great angle, tones and lighting.</td>', 'neat. 3 columns make for a nice composition. great angle, tones and lighting.', '2003-02-12 18:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(214433, 12161, 806, '<td valign="top">good angle. lacks in focus. great colors.</td>', 'good angle. lacks in focus. great colors.', '2003-02-12 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(214434, 12060, 806, '<td valign="top">good idea. the yellow parts attract my eye, leading me to the far left of the frame. since the rest of the photo is so monotone, it would benefit this to be composed tighter in to eliminate some of the excess that the eye doesn''t want to see on the right anyway. clarity .. pretty good focus. nice subject.</td>', 'good idea. the yellow parts attract my eye, leading me to the far left of the frame. since the rest of the photo is so monotone, it would benefit this to be composed tighter in to eliminate some of the excess that the eye doesn''t want to see on the right anyway. clarity .. pretty good focus. nice subject.', '2003-02-12 18:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(214435, 12308, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Like the fact that you included some of the barn next to the silo.  Not everyone knows what a silo is nor what it''s for.  I personally would have liked to see more of the dairy barn that is attached.  But it is a great photo as you have taken it.  Beautiful photo with great focus.  Like the angle of the shot, shows the magnitude of the silo.  Good job.</td>', 'Good composition.  Like the fact that you included some of the barn next to the silo.  Not everyone knows what a silo is nor what it''s for.  I personally would have liked to see more of the dairy barn that is attached.  But it is a great photo as you have taken it.  Beautiful photo with great focus.  Like the angle of the shot, shows the magnitude of the silo.  Good job.', '2003-02-12 18:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(214436, 12146, 806, '<td valign="top">nice colors... neat concept and exectution is good. I would probably crop out the right side some more. the extra dark area doesn''t add to the composition.. a more square frame would benefit this.</td>', 'nice colors... neat concept and exectution is good. I would probably crop out the right side some more. the extra dark area doesn''t add to the composition.. a more square frame would benefit this.', '2003-02-12 18:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(214441, 12156, 806, '<td valign="top">I think you may have been able to crop a bit tighter on the sides.. otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I think you may have been able to crop a bit tighter on the sides.. otherwise a nice shot.', '2003-02-12 18:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(214445, 12292, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need to be more careful of your background.  The leaf on the wall appears to be hanging out of his ear.  The people on the wall appear to be standing on his shoulder.  This photo is very much perspective.  Has a yellow cast to it that is disturbing.  The wall is not out of focus, nor is it in focus;  needs to one way or the other.  Nice compotision, just needs better execution.</td>', 'Need to be more careful of your background.  The leaf on the wall appears to be hanging out of his ear.  The people on the wall appear to be standing on his shoulder.  This photo is very much perspective.  Has a yellow cast to it that is disturbing.  The wall is not out of focus, nor is it in focus;  needs to one way or the other.  Nice compotision, just needs better execution.', '2003-02-12 18:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(214447, 12056, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too oversharpened for me.  Looks like you tried to get it to look like a sketch, which you almost accomplished, but not quite.  Others will think it is great.  Just not personally appealing to me.</td>', 'Too oversharpened for me.  Looks like you tried to get it to look like a sketch, which you almost accomplished, but not quite.  Others will think it is great.  Just not personally appealing to me.', '2003-02-12 18:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(214451, 12149, 4648, '<td valign="top">As for putting something into perspective, this photo takes the cake.  A lot of people need to look at this.  Great shot.  Love the texture to the gloves.  This is a really good photo, well done.  Congratulations.</td>', 'As for putting something into perspective, this photo takes the cake.  A lot of people need to look at this.  Great shot.  Love the texture to the gloves.  This is a really good photo, well done.  Congratulations.', '2003-02-12 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(214456, 12265, 4648, '<td valign="top">What was put into perspective here?  The eyebrow pierce?  Give you credit for a really good macro.  Great job.  How is it in color?  With the skin texture so clear I would love to have seen it in color.</td>', 'What was put into perspective here?  The eyebrow pierce?  Give you credit for a really good macro.  Great job.  How is it in color?  With the skin texture so clear I would love to have seen it in color.', '2003-02-12 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(214462, 12101, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The black and white is perfect, excellent contrast, good lighting, and the subject(s) are adorable.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The black and white is perfect, excellent contrast, good lighting, and the subject(s) are adorable.', '2003-02-12 19:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(214464, 12299, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, sure puts things into perspective for me.  Very nice, thought provoking shot.</td>', 'Wow, sure puts things into perspective for me.  Very nice, thought provoking shot.', '2003-02-12 19:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(214465, 12108, 772, '<td valign="top">I love a flag photo.. Not just the American flag, but any flag... I applaud you for doing this shot :)  Excellent composition and the colors pop nicely :) great shot.. - setzler</td>', 'I love a flag photo.. Not just the American flag, but any flag... I applaud you for doing this shot :)  Excellent composition and the colors pop nicely :) great shot.. - setzler', '2003-02-12 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(214467, 12139, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really powerful perspective photo... I think the color in it looks a bit strange and this could possibly make a very strong black and white... the bit of red in the center is a nice element thoug.. great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a really powerful perspective photo... I think the color in it looks a bit strange and this could possibly make a very strong black and white... the bit of red in the center is a nice element thoug.. great shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-12 19:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(214469, 12118, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The sepia is gorgeous, and a good fit for this shot.  Lighting and contrast are good, the repetitive pattern of the trees, as well as the perspective  really make this shot stand out.  One of my few 10''s this week.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The sepia is gorgeous, and a good fit for this shot.  Lighting and contrast are good, the repetitive pattern of the trees, as well as the perspective  really make this shot stand out.  One of my few 10''s this week.', '2003-02-12 19:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(214470, 12265, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent perspective shot!  The eyes really make this work well for me.. espceially since they are looking off to the side.. great work and kudos on the choice of black and white :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent perspective shot!  The eyes really make this work well for me.. espceially since they are looking off to the side.. great work and kudos on the choice of black and white :) - setzler', '2003-02-12 19:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(214473, 12248, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely landscape.. the bright green and the deep blue in the sky offers a wonderful contrast in this shot.. there appears to be a small amount of noise in the sky area.. possibly from saturation... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'this is a lovely landscape.. the bright green and the deep blue in the sky offers a wonderful contrast in this shot.. there appears to be a small amount of noise in the sky area.. possibly from saturation... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-12 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(214485, 12304, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent perspective shot.. the detail and clarity and dof is phenomenal... i also like the cloud in the corner.. that upsets the balance nicely.. great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent perspective shot.. the detail and clarity and dof is phenomenal... i also like the cloud in the corner.. that upsets the balance nicely.. great shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-12 19:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(214488, 12278, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the red and the abstract nature of this shot... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'I really like the red and the abstract nature of this shot... great work :) - setzler', '2003-02-12 19:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(214492, 12130, 6651, '<td valign="top">I guess that would 2 types of perspective, eh?</td>', 'I guess that would 2 types of perspective, eh?', '2003-02-12 19:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(214501, 12288, 6661, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2003-02-12 19:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(214503, 12272, 6661, '<td valign="top">I like that the point of focus is slightly offset.</td>', 'I like that the point of focus is slightly offset.', '2003-02-12 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(214505, 12106, 6661, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.</td>', 'Interesting angle.', '2003-02-12 19:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
