(214550, 12213, 6651, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast</td>', 'Nice contrast', '2003-02-12 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(214555, 12299, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It''s mystical and really inspiring to me.  I''d give it a 10 if I could vote. :)</td>', 'Very nice.  It''s mystical and really inspiring to me.  I''d give it a 10 if I could vote. :)', '2003-02-12 21:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(214556, 12306, 4494, '<td valign="top">I really like it that the left side of the building is horizontal in the pic and the right side is almost verticle.  Excellent perspective!!  And the lighting is very nice also. 9.</td>', 'I really like it that the left side of the building is horizontal in the pic and the right side is almost verticle.  Excellent perspective!!  And the lighting is very nice also. 9.', '2003-02-12 21:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(214558, 12278, 4494, '<td valign="top">Deep within...  the cheese graters!  Pretty cool!</td>', 'Deep within...  the cheese graters!  Pretty cool!', '2003-02-12 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(214559, 12130, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha love it.</td>', 'Hahahaha love it.', '2003-02-12 21:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(214562, 12308, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really show any perspective.</td>', 'Doesn''t really show any perspective.', '2003-02-12 21:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(214565, 12165, 4494, '<td valign="top">Only thing is the brick wall ruins the illusion of height of the tree.</td>', 'Only thing is the brick wall ruins the illusion of height of the tree.', '2003-02-12 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(214566, 12185, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent it really looks like a long peir all the way out to the island!  8.</td>', 'Excellent it really looks like a long peir all the way out to the island!  8.', '2003-02-12 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(214567, 12310, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat, how''d you do it?</td>', 'Pretty neat, how''d you do it?', '2003-02-12 21:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(214568, 12052, 4494, '<td valign="top">How bizzare... it looks like a normal toothbrush.  How''d you get that effect??</td>', 'How bizzare... it looks like a normal toothbrush.  How''d you get that effect??', '2003-02-12 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(214573, 12268, 806, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! How did you ever get sunrise/sunset type tones in the pillars with such a nice blue sky outside? Symmetry, ... can''t say anymore. It renders me speechless.</td>', 'This is gorgeous! How did you ever get sunrise/sunset type tones in the pillars with such a nice blue sky outside? Symmetry, ... can''t say anymore. It renders me speechless.', '2003-02-12 21:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(214575, 12213, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ha love it... the color, perspective, focus is great.  One question... Did you have a domino missing somewhere down the line in case the shot wasn''t good and you had to redo it? :)  Nice pic.</td>', 'Ha love it... the color, perspective, focus is great.  One question... Did you have a domino missing somewhere down the line in case the shot wasn''t good and you had to redo it? :)  Nice pic.', '2003-02-12 21:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(214577, 12263, 4494, '<td valign="top">The contrast of her agaisnt the slightly blurry background is great!  I really like it.</td>', 'The contrast of her agaisnt the slightly blurry background is great!  I really like it.', '2003-02-12 21:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(214578, 12183, 806, '<td valign="top">It is interesting that the three different levels have such different activity on them. Gives the impression of three different times as the building is so symmetrical, and the portraits on the wall so similar. Could almost be morning, noon and night. LOL. Too cool.<br/>Focus could be sharper.. but I really like the image.</td>', 'It is interesting that the three different levels have such different activity on them. Gives the impression of three different times as the building is so symmetrical, and the portraits on the wall so similar. Could almost be morning, noon and night. LOL. Too cool.Focus could be sharper.. but I really like the image.', '2003-02-12 21:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(214580, 12178, 806, '<td valign="top">awesome. love the contrast in the lighting.. the texture.. the framing.. <br/>a common subject elevated by being done so well! bravo!</td>', 'awesome. love the contrast in the lighting.. the texture.. the framing.. a common subject elevated by being done so well! bravo!', '2003-02-12 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(214581, 12130, 806, '<td valign="top">neat. i like the inclusion of the solar flare too.</td>', 'neat. i like the inclusion of the solar flare too.', '2003-02-12 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(214583, 12285, 806, '<td valign="top">excellent macro! would like to see the tip of his nose in focus too, but the short dof beyond the eye is good. if the nose was in focus, I''d be jumping away from my monitor!!.. as it is.. I am skittish.</td>', 'excellent macro! would like to see the tip of his nose in focus too, but the short dof beyond the eye is good. if the nose was in focus, I''d be jumping away from my monitor!!.. as it is.. I am skittish.', '2003-02-12 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(214585, 12286, 806, '<td valign="top">very clear and lovely photo with great lighting. perspective? stretching it a bit. but I like it.</td>', 'very clear and lovely photo with great lighting. perspective? stretching it a bit. but I like it.', '2003-02-12 22:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(214590, 12176, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well done... the perspective of the buildings is great and the tree lighting is very good.</td>', 'Well done... the perspective of the buildings is great and the tree lighting is very good.', '2003-02-12 22:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(214592, 12178, 4793, '<td valign="top">Try cropping  down from the top about 1 inch and I think you will see how dramatic this photo will be, you don''t need the sunny spot on the top left, your perspective focus is straight down the tracks, a lovely photo.</td>', 'Try cropping  down from the top about 1 inch and I think you will see how dramatic this photo will be, you don''t need the sunny spot on the top left, your perspective focus is straight down the tracks, a lovely photo.', '2003-02-12 22:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(214593, 12204, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  I love the flag all stretched out like this!!</td>', 'Good shot!  I love the flag all stretched out like this!!', '2003-02-12 22:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(214595, 12245, 4494, '<td valign="top">Whew, that''s nice!  Is the property for sale?!! :)  Not that I could afford it.  You maybe should have stepped a little closer to the fence and angled the camera to the right to get more perspective on the fence.  Great shot tho!  8.</td>', 'Whew, that''s nice!  Is the property for sale?!! :)  Not that I could afford it.  You maybe should have stepped a little closer to the fence and angled the camera to the right to get more perspective on the fence.  Great shot tho!  8.', '2003-02-12 22:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(214597, 12248, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that is so awesome looking... the pic is so clear you see every single stone perfectly.  Love this one!  9.</td>', 'Wow that is so awesome looking... the pic is so clear you see every single stone perfectly.  Love this one!  9.', '2003-02-12 22:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(214598, 12243, 4793, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2003-02-12 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(214601, 12109, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture but it''s hard to tell how big it is (perspective) because there''s nothing close to it.  I seems like it would be big so you should have put a small child next to it or something.</td>', 'Very nice picture but it''s hard to tell how big it is (perspective) because there''s nothing close to it.  I seems like it would be big so you should have put a small child next to it or something.', '2003-02-12 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(214602, 12149, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... there''s something a little distracting on the right but no big deal...  Your title is great as well:  I''ve seen some pretty PISSED OFF golfers when their game is going perfectly, and I think, "why don''t they put things into perpective!?"  :)<br/></td>', 'Nice shot... there''s something a little distracting on the right but no big deal...  Your title is great as well:  I''ve seen some pretty PISSED OFF golfers when their game is going perfectly, and I think, "why don''t they put things into perpective!?"  :)', '2003-02-12 22:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(214603, 12271, 4494, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like to many dog pics, but this one does show the entire body, and plus he looks like a great dawg!!  7.</td>', 'I usually don''t like to many dog pics, but this one does show the entire body, and plus he looks like a great dawg!!  7.', '2003-02-12 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(214605, 12302, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, serene, really nice shot, good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful, serene, really nice shot, good luck.', '2003-02-12 22:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
