(214611, 12285, 4494, '<td valign="top">Is he/she your pet?  Pefect focus on the eye but I''d rather see the enter head (eye and nose) in focus.</td>', 'Is he/she your pet?  Pefect focus on the eye but I''d rather see the enter head (eye and nose) in focus.', '2003-02-12 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(214614, 12289, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love the placement of the pole and flag!  Excellent!!  I''d almost like to see the moon out of the pic but that''s OK.</td>', 'Nice, I love the placement of the pole and flag!  Excellent!!  I''d almost like to see the moon out of the pic but that''s OK.', '2003-02-12 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(214615, 12223, 4494, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer tree pics... The white bark against the deep blue sky is absolutely stunning.  9.  Very good!</td>', 'One of the nicer tree pics... The white bark against the deep blue sky is absolutely stunning.  9.  Very good!', '2003-02-12 22:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(214616, 12260, 4494, '<td valign="top">That''s a great picture... did you arrange those peices at the bottom or were they like that?  Anyway, great!!</td>', 'That''s a great picture... did you arrange those peices at the bottom or were they like that?  Anyway, great!!', '2003-02-12 23:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(214619, 12076, 6758, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful.  I like the pole leading up.</td>', 'This is very beautiful.  I like the pole leading up.', '2003-02-12 23:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(214658, 12304, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is dramatic and effective but a little monotonous. The centred composition is very formal, and there isn''t much about the tower that captures my interest. The little puff of cloud in the top left is a great touch though.</td>', 'This photo is dramatic and effective but a little monotonous. The centred composition is very formal, and there isn''t much about the tower that captures my interest. The little puff of cloud in the top left is a great touch though.', '2003-02-13 06:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(214659, 12288, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool textures, and the use of perspective is great. I feel like it''s a little tilted though, and underexposed since the colours are all a bit pale. If you turned up the saturation a little it could have been very vivid. I just saved it and tried playing with it, and it looks VERY cool in high contrast black and white too.</td>', 'Very cool textures, and the use of perspective is great. I feel like it''s a little tilted though, and underexposed since the colours are all a bit pale. If you turned up the saturation a little it could have been very vivid. I just saved it and tried playing with it, and it looks VERY cool in high contrast black and white too.', '2003-02-13 06:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(214660, 12263, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow... this photo is beautiful. I''m not sure that it really displays "regret", as the title suggests. But it''s a really gorgeous work of art. The branches from the tree, the window, and its reflections are great elements of the image even though the shallow DOF places them firmly in the background and leads you right to the woman''s face. The camera angle on her face is gorgeous. The only problem I have is that the darkness of her clothing makes it hard to interpret. Is it a big turtleneck sweater? Her neck has disappeared into a black hole. I still like it though. For some reason it has a kind of 60s feel to it.</td>', 'Wow... this photo is beautiful. I''m not sure that it really displays "regret", as the title suggests. But it''s a really gorgeous work of art. The branches from the tree, the window, and its reflections are great elements of the image even though the shallow DOF places them firmly in the background and leads you right to the woman''s face. The camera angle on her face is gorgeous. The only problem I have is that the darkness of her clothing makes it hard to interpret. Is it a big turtleneck sweater? Her neck has disappeared into a black hole. I still like it though. For some reason it has a kind of 60s feel to it.', '2003-02-13 06:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(214661, 12287, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. The tiny size of the moon helps the "perspective" theme along, I think. The sky is a lovely mauve colour. I like the fine patterning of the twigs and branches, and the composition of the tree trunk.</td>', 'Pretty. The tiny size of the moon helps the "perspective" theme along, I think. The sky is a lovely mauve colour. I like the fine patterning of the twigs and branches, and the composition of the tree trunk.', '2003-02-13 06:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(214662, 12272, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely shallow DOF and rich black and white. I''m not sure that the subject of the photo is interesting to me though. If it had more texture and weathering, or was more fancy, it would hold my interest, but this seems kind of static and boring.</td>', 'Lovely shallow DOF and rich black and white. I''m not sure that the subject of the photo is interesting to me though. If it had more texture and weathering, or was more fancy, it would hold my interest, but this seems kind of static and boring.', '2003-02-13 06:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(214663, 12254, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines, and nice textures on the pole. The composition is good. The Black and white has nice, rich dark tones but doesn''t seem to go all the way up to the whites, making the photo a little too grey overall for my liking. I just tried playing with it, and with a lighter sky the pole stands out beautifully. Perhaps it''s because my monitor is calibrated for the squares on the bottom of the voting page.</td>', 'Interesting lines, and nice textures on the pole. The composition is good. The Black and white has nice, rich dark tones but doesn''t seem to go all the way up to the whites, making the photo a little too grey overall for my liking. I just tried playing with it, and with a lighter sky the pole stands out beautifully. Perhaps it''s because my monitor is calibrated for the squares on the bottom of the voting page.', '2003-02-13 06:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(214664, 12161, 1037, '<td valign="top">Anniiiiiiida.... i love the vivid colours in this photo, but after seeing a bunch of others so far in voting on this challenge, the low resolution of the camera does stand out, making the photo seem soft. I also don''t think it focussed on the top of the palm tree. The very closest part of the tree is sharper. It''s so bold and vivid though, I like it :).</td>', 'Anniiiiiiida.... i love the vivid colours in this photo, but after seeing a bunch of others so far in voting on this challenge, the low resolution of the camera does stand out, making the photo seem soft. I also don''t think it focussed on the top of the palm tree. The very closest part of the tree is sharper. It''s so bold and vivid though, I like it :).', '2003-02-13 06:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(214665, 12248, 1037, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, but the photo is busy. It doesn''t need all the trees to be there. Take a much smaller crop of the photo and you''ll have something with loads of impact.<br/> <br/>In fact, I just tried it out. I cropped it, enlarged it slightly, sharpened it and played a little with the colours, then added a border. Tell me what you think:<br/> <br/>//lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/valourExperiment.jpg</td>', 'Good perspective, but the photo is busy. It doesn''t need all the trees to be there. Take a much smaller crop of the photo and you''ll have something with loads of impact. In fact, I just tried it out. I cropped it, enlarged it slightly, sharpened it and played a little with the colours, then added a border. Tell me what you think: //lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/valourExperiment.jpg', '2003-02-13 06:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(214666, 12306, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. What can I say? This is a breathtaking work of art. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful. What can I say? This is a breathtaking work of art. 10.', '2003-02-13 06:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(214691, 12202, 772, '<td valign="top">nice work with the strong diagonals.. this black and white looks really nice.. excellent work with the exposure here... - setzler</td>', 'nice work with the strong diagonals.. this black and white looks really nice.. excellent work with the exposure here... - setzler', '2003-02-13 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(214692, 12206, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting idea on the perapective challenge... the red stands out nicely here and the reflections give it a nice abstract feel.. nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'very interesting idea on the perapective challenge... the red stands out nicely here and the reflections give it a nice abstract feel.. nice work :) - setzler', '2003-02-13 09:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(214693, 12308, 2989, '<td valign="top">It''s a very crisp shor, which I like, and the interesting perspective makes this silo appaer a lot taller than in a more normal boring shot.  Great colors from the sky. - xertion</td>', 'It''s a very crisp shor, which I like, and the interesting perspective makes this silo appaer a lot taller than in a more normal boring shot.  Great colors from the sky. - xertion', '2003-02-13 09:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(214694, 12156, 2989, '<td valign="top">The perspective is very intriguing in this shot.  The odd choice of sunlight does take a little away from this shot.  Waiting might have proved to show better results.  A few orange and white things in the shot are distracting, but it''s a great shot indeed! - xertion</td>', 'The perspective is very intriguing in this shot.  The odd choice of sunlight does take a little away from this shot.  Waiting might have proved to show better results.  A few orange and white things in the shot are distracting, but it''s a great shot indeed! - xertion', '2003-02-13 09:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(214696, 12223, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-02-13 09:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(214697, 12260, 2989, '<td valign="top">The positioning and choice of this subject are great.  The dark colors along with the burnt orange rust color against the snow, it all adds up to be a very good choice for this weeks challenge... 10!  - xertion</td>', 'The positioning and choice of this subject are great.  The dark colors along with the burnt orange rust color against the snow, it all adds up to be a very good choice for this weeks challenge... 10!  - xertion', '2003-02-13 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(214700, 12301, 1280, '<td valign="top">good eye!</td>', 'good eye!', '2003-02-13 09:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(214701, 12118, 2989, '<td valign="top">What an amazing spot to find.  The trees alone would make for a great shot, but the lake and the sepia tone, it all forms together to make an amazing shot.  I can''t really offer any advice, it''s already photographically perfect.  Great shot...10! - xertion</td>', 'What an amazing spot to find.  The trees alone would make for a great shot, but the lake and the sepia tone, it all forms together to make an amazing shot.  I can''t really offer any advice, it''s already photographically perfect.  Great shot...10! - xertion', '2003-02-13 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(214702, 12159, 2989, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge.  There is always a way to squeeze a flower into every challenge, and this time you managed to do it.  Crisp focus and very soothing bright blue sky.  Great shot...9! - xertion</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge.  There is always a way to squeeze a flower into every challenge, and this time you managed to do it.  Crisp focus and very soothing bright blue sky.  Great shot...9! - xertion', '2003-02-13 09:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(214704, 12296, 2989, '<td valign="top">The subject creates its own very interesting perspective, and you found that point og interest nicely.  Improving on the shot, I would have a wider aperature so that more or all of the "track" was in focus.</td>', 'The subject creates its own very interesting perspective, and you found that point og interest nicely.  Improving on the shot, I would have a wider aperature so that more or all of the "track" was in focus.', '2003-02-13 09:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(214705, 12243, 2989, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot for the cimple fact that you took a shot you knew other would do, railroad tracks, and made it your own.  The tilt of the camera creates the same looks with a much more interesting effect.  My eye is drawn to that vanishing point no matter where I look in the shot.  The warm red/brown tint also adds to this shot.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot for the cimple fact that you took a shot you knew other would do, railroad tracks, and made it your own.  The tilt of the camera creates the same looks with a much more interesting effect.  My eye is drawn to that vanishing point no matter where I look in the shot.  The warm red/brown tint also adds to this shot.', '2003-02-13 09:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(214706, 12290, 6097, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!  I love the angle that you took this shot from.  I really like how the windows are reflecting the blue sky.  This is my favorite shot this week (besides my own, of course  :-)  ).</td>', 'Great Shot!  I love the angle that you took this shot from.  I really like how the windows are reflecting the blue sky.  This is my favorite shot this week (besides my own, of course  :-)  ).', '2003-02-13 09:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(214721, 12201, 5898, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and composition, lighting is dark and the light at the top of the building is distracting. Another time of day  would have allowed for better lighting or some creative shadows.</td>', 'Great perspective and composition, lighting is dark and the light at the top of the building is distracting. Another time of day  would have allowed for better lighting or some creative shadows.', '2003-02-13 10:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(214723, 12129, 5898, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and use of line to create your composition.</td>', 'Good perspective and use of line to create your composition.', '2003-02-13 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(214796, 12159, 6696, '<td valign="top">Wow - very nice.  Top 5 material</td>', 'Wow - very nice.  Top 5 material', '2003-02-13 13:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(214797, 12302, 6696, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter - nice shot.</td>', 'Good subject matter - nice shot.', '2003-02-13 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(214803, 12200, 6696, '<td valign="top">One of the better towering tree photos.  Good color.</td>', 'One of the better towering tree photos.  Good color.', '2003-02-13 13:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(214812, 12244, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is cool. The focus is very soft, but I love the composition and the stark contrasts. This photo puts me in an interesting space. I''m not sure where it is, but there''s a sense of vastness and airiness to it.</td>', 'This is cool. The focus is very soft, but I love the composition and the stark contrasts. This photo puts me in an interesting space. I''m not sure where it is, but there''s a sense of vastness and airiness to it.', '2003-02-13 14:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(214813, 12235, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. The composition feels just right, and the colours are gorgeous. A study in blueish grey tones.</td>', 'Very lovely. The composition feels just right, and the colours are gorgeous. A study in blueish grey tones.', '2003-02-13 14:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(214815, 12146, 1037, '<td valign="top">Odd how the composition of this is ultimately centred, but it doesn''t feel as though it is. I really like the colours in this photo, and the sense of barrenness. I don''t know how you took this without being terrified! This space scares me. I''d hate to be alone in there at night. High marks for being so evokative.</td>', 'Odd how the composition of this is ultimately centred, but it doesn''t feel as though it is. I really like the colours in this photo, and the sense of barrenness. I don''t know how you took this without being terrified! This space scares me. I''d hate to be alone in there at night. High marks for being so evokative.', '2003-02-13 14:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(214816, 12241, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love how his one blue eye and raised eyebrow peer out defiantly behind that milk container :). You caught something really intrinsic to domestic, family life. I''m not sure that it meets the challenge though, and I know a lot of people must be screaming "SNAPSHOT!" at you, but I think this photo has merit.</td>', 'I love how his one blue eye and raised eyebrow peer out defiantly behind that milk container :). You caught something really intrinsic to domestic, family life. I''m not sure that it meets the challenge though, and I know a lot of people must be screaming "SNAPSHOT!" at you, but I think this photo has merit.', '2003-02-13 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(214868, 12139, 656, '<td valign="top">Great - almost would like it more with the sky cropped out of the shot ?</td>', 'Great - almost would like it more with the sky cropped out of the shot ?', '2003-02-13 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(214869, 12260, 656, '<td valign="top">LIke the use of foreground elements - I wonder if just the bolts on the sleeper would have simplified things and made it more dramatic ?</td>', 'LIke the use of foreground elements - I wonder if just the bolts on the sleeper would have simplified things and made it more dramatic ?', '2003-02-13 15:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
