(214872, 12302, 656, '<td valign="top">lovely, unreal/ surreal colour feel to it.  It''s jus too green and verdant</td>', 'lovely, unreal/ surreal colour feel to it.  It''s jus too green and verdant', '2003-02-13 15:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
