(214913, 12244, 1005, '<td valign="top">Tough shot (shooting from darkness out to a heavily light area).  Far background doesn''t come through very well, but the subject (I assume) is the lights and archways.  Focus is, well hard to say where.  Color - minimal, due to lighting conditions.  Overall, I doesn''t "grab" me.  6 Swash</td>', 'Tough shot (shooting from darkness out to a heavily light area).  Far background doesn''t come through very well, but the subject (I assume) is the lights and archways.  Focus is, well hard to say where.  Color - minimal, due to lighting conditions.  Overall, I doesn''t "grab" me.  6 Swash', '2003-02-13 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(214915, 12165, 1005, '<td valign="top">Focus is a limited DOF, but good in the middle of the photo.  The leaves seem to hide much of the perspective part.  It doesn''t look like a "good" tree to climb.  Color seems a tad diminished, but not bad.  6 Swash</td>', 'Focus is a limited DOF, but good in the middle of the photo.  The leaves seem to hide much of the perspective part.  It doesn''t look like a "good" tree to climb.  Color seems a tad diminished, but not bad.  6 Swash', '2003-02-13 16:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(214918, 12230, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo.  Color seems good, but maybe just a tad diminished (probably due to the cloudy day).  The background seems cluttered and largely unnecessary.  (On the far left bottom, am I seeing the far rail ending? Like the train doesn''t have far to travel?)  6 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo.  Color seems good, but maybe just a tad diminished (probably due to the cloudy day).  The background seems cluttered and largely unnecessary.  (On the far left bottom, am I seeing the far rail ending? Like the train doesn''t have far to travel?)  6 Swash', '2003-02-13 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(214921, 12130, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, that''s low!  Very good color, framing and focus.  While I like the inclusion of the sun, the sunflares across the photo don''t seem to add a benefit.  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting perspective, that''s low!  Very good color, framing and focus.  While I like the inclusion of the sun, the sunflares across the photo don''t seem to add a benefit.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 16:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(214924, 12278, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the red coloration with the grater, nice combo.  The white light seems to take away more than I see it adding (was it needed to create enough light to make the shot?)  The cheese slicing side of the grater seems incongruous with the other three sides, could it have been placed at the top right, instead of the bottom left (to lessen it''s impact)?  The mask seems somewhat grainy.  7 Swash</td>', 'I like the red coloration with the grater, nice combo.  The white light seems to take away more than I see it adding (was it needed to create enough light to make the shot?)  The cheese slicing side of the grater seems incongruous with the other three sides, could it have been placed at the top right, instead of the bottom left (to lessen it''s impact)?  The mask seems somewhat grainy.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(214928, 12270, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty vase/glass sculpture.  Very nice color.  Framing is top notch and so is the focus.  The big glare spot (as well as the other four smaller ones) don''t enhanse the beauty of the subject, maybe bright, but softer lighting.  This might be interesting with lighting from the inside, just an idea.  This kinda qualifies as OPA, as I don''t really see much that you added to this piece (sorry, that''s a in my opinion thing).  7 Swash</td>', 'Pretty vase/glass sculpture.  Very nice color.  Framing is top notch and so is the focus.  The big glare spot (as well as the other four smaller ones) don''t enhanse the beauty of the subject, maybe bright, but softer lighting.  This might be interesting with lighting from the inside, just an idea.  This kinda qualifies as OPA, as I don''t really see much that you added to this piece (sorry, that''s a in my opinion thing).  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(214929, 12306, 1005, '<td valign="top">Solid focus and a nice amount of contrast.  Good patterns.  Ouchy glare on the sky part.  7 Swash</td>', 'Solid focus and a nice amount of contrast.  Good patterns.  Ouchy glare on the sky part.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(214930, 12143, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective, challenge well met.  It seems bright enough, but the color still seems on the subdued side (maybe just a little).  Good focus/framing.  I know you couldn''t "do" anything about the "blotches" on the cement, but I just don''t care for it.  (possible earthquake inspection? and no score affect)  7 Swash</td>', 'Very good perspective, challenge well met.  It seems bright enough, but the color still seems on the subdued side (maybe just a little).  Good focus/framing.  I know you couldn''t "do" anything about the "blotches" on the cement, but I just don''t care for it.  (possible earthquake inspection? and no score affect)  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(214931, 12070, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  Color and focus seem very good.  Challenge aspect - O.K., but low creativity.  Background - not good, cluttered/mixed.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very cute shot.  Color and focus seem very good.  Challenge aspect - O.K., but low creativity.  Background - not good, cluttered/mixed.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
