(214936, 12195, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of the candle and box.  Good focus/framing and contrast.  I''m not certain about the challenge, but I''m not going to penalize you heavily for my not understanding it.  Interest - moderate to low (sorry).  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo of the candle and box.  Good focus/framing and contrast.  I''m not certain about the challenge, but I''m not going to penalize you heavily for my not understanding it.  Interest - moderate to low (sorry).  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
