(214941, 12286, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty cat!  Very good focus and color.  Challenge - well, I''m just not sure how this fits, but let''s not be too heavy handed (mostly due to my lack of knowledge).  Good detail!  7 Swash</td>', 'Very pretty cat!  Very good focus and color.  Challenge - well, I''m just not sure how this fits, but let''s not be too heavy handed (mostly due to my lack of knowledge).  Good detail!  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
