(214944, 12238, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good shot of this stairway.  Focus seems very sharp.  Contrast is very good.  Interest - moderate to low (sorry).  7 Swash</td>', 'Good shot of this stairway.  Focus seems very sharp.  Contrast is very good.  Interest - moderate to low (sorry).  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 17:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(214945, 12192, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot (street seems VERY long and NARROW).  Focus seems just a little weak and the color needs more saturation (the sky is blown out, but it''s not a significant part of the photo, nor is it likely that you could have done much about that!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Good perspective shot (street seems VERY long and NARROW).  Focus seems just a little weak and the color needs more saturation (the sky is blown out, but it''s not a significant part of the photo, nor is it likely that you could have done much about that!)  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(214946, 12129, 1005, '<td valign="top">Strong image!  Very good perspective shot.  Focus seems sharp.  With just two colors, there''s not alot I can comment on for color, but the contrast is very good.  Interest - gets better with more viewing (really nice patterns) moderate to good.  Score upgrade from 7 to 8 (congrats!)  Swash</td>', 'Strong image!  Very good perspective shot.  Focus seems sharp.  With just two colors, there''s not alot I can comment on for color, but the contrast is very good.  Interest - gets better with more viewing (really nice patterns) moderate to good.  Score upgrade from 7 to 8 (congrats!)  Swash', '2003-02-13 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(214947, 12241, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute (in a BAD way) shot!  Very good focus and color.  The flash was needed, but the shadows and glare spot aren''t as good for the pic.  Challenge aspect - I''m just not sure, so I''m not going to add OR subtract points for it.  Interest - kind of funny, moderate interest level.  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute (in a BAD way) shot!  Very good focus and color.  The flash was needed, but the shadows and glare spot aren''t as good for the pic.  Challenge aspect - I''m just not sure, so I''m not going to add OR subtract points for it.  Interest - kind of funny, moderate interest level.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(214948, 12139, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, that way, of course!  Good perspective shot.  Good color (except for the sky? part)  Focus seems good.  Interest - moderate.  7 Swash</td>', 'Well, that way, of course!  Good perspective shot.  Good color (except for the sky? part)  Focus seems good.  Interest - moderate.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(214949, 12254, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken shot of this telephone pole.  Challenge aspect - met.  Contrast is O.K.  Focus - better than O.K., but not super great.  Interest - sorry, but low.  7 Swash</td>', 'Well taken shot of this telephone pole.  Challenge aspect - met.  Contrast is O.K.  Focus - better than O.K., but not super great.  Interest - sorry, but low.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(214950, 12074, 1005, '<td valign="top">Perspective - there, but very short.  Focus is good, except of course, the cap of the pen.  Color seems pretty good.  (Relax the deathgrip on the pen!)  Interest - moderate to low (sorry).  7 Swash</td>', 'Perspective - there, but very short.  Focus is good, except of course, the cap of the pen.  Color seems pretty good.  (Relax the deathgrip on the pen!)  Interest - moderate to low (sorry).  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(214951, 12287, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like how the tree seems to be bending over your.  Focus is fine.  Framing - works well enough.  Color - hard to say, twilight dims most colors, but I do like the purplish blue sky.  The moon is a nice touch, but not really big enough to impact the photo much either way.  Interest - moderate.  7 Swash</td>', 'I like how the tree seems to be bending over your.  Focus is fine.  Framing - works well enough.  Color - hard to say, twilight dims most colors, but I do like the purplish blue sky.  The moon is a nice touch, but not really big enough to impact the photo much either way.  Interest - moderate.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(214952, 12069, 1005, '<td valign="top">Are these handcuffs? (maybe an older design?)  Interesting how you focused on the far "cuff" and not on the nearer one (that''s kinda nice/different).  Framing - works well enough, lined up basically on the 1/3 line.  Color - well, there''s not alot to work with there (no score affect).  Interest moderate to good.  Score upgrade from 7 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Are these handcuffs? (maybe an older design?)  Interesting how you focused on the far "cuff" and not on the nearer one (that''s kinda nice/different).  Framing - works well enough, lined up basically on the 1/3 line.  Color - well, there''s not alot to work with there (no score affect).  Interest moderate to good.  Score upgrade from 7 to 8.  Swash', '2003-02-13 18:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(214953, 12285, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very scary!  Good shot!  Color seems very good.  Focus is a narrow DOF, which works, but I would have preferred from the tip of his nose to eyes, rather than  from the eyes back.  In focus parts are very detailed.  I really like the reflections in it''s eye.  Challenge met.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very scary!  Good shot!  Color seems very good.  Focus is a narrow DOF, which works, but I would have preferred from the tip of his nose to eyes, rather than  from the eyes back.  In focus parts are very detailed.  I really like the reflections in it''s eye.  Challenge met.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(214954, 12056, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat row of trees.  Contrasts are pretty good, but the tangle of branches takes away some of the clarity that strong contrast usually offers.  7 Swash</td>', 'Neat row of trees.  Contrasts are pretty good, but the tangle of branches takes away some of the clarity that strong contrast usually offers.  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(214964, 12302, 806, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the sky and the white windmills, and the green pasture. nice depth in the photo, and the cattle add a sense of scale and distance. the way the hill is sloped down and to the right adds movement and interest, and I like how it is doesn''t cut the photo in half, even diagonally. Nice clarity. Job well done!<br/> <br/>edit: My daughters critique (9 yrs old): It''s colorful, and interesting. I like how the windmills are arranged, and slope down along the hill. I also like the cows.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the sky and the white windmills, and the green pasture. nice depth in the photo, and the cattle add a sense of scale and distance. the way the hill is sloped down and to the right adds movement and interest, and I like how it is doesn''t cut the photo in half, even diagonally. Nice clarity. Job well done! edit: My daughters critique (9 yrs old): It''s colorful, and interesting. I like how the windmills are arranged, and slope down along the hill. I also like the cows.', '2003-02-13 18:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(214966, 12101, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful! awesome lighting. even tones. look how the girl on the far left is looking into the photo... further enhancing the eye''s lead in along the rail and wall. skip - skip - skip along the line of girls whose heads and toes further lead you to the last little girl on the end.. who looks like she has to pee! LOL how darling! what a moment! beautifully captured!</td>', 'beautiful! awesome lighting. even tones. look how the girl on the far left is looking into the photo... further enhancing the eye''s lead in along the rail and wall. skip - skip - skip along the line of girls whose heads and toes further lead you to the last little girl on the end.. who looks like she has to pee! LOL how darling! what a moment! beautifully captured!', '2003-02-13 18:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(214968, 12299, 806, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. emotive. even tones to set the scene of tranquility.. awesome work! you should be proud.<br/> <br/>Edit: My daughter''s (9 yrs old) interpretation... I like the sky. It looks like a time portal that is opening for the children.</td>', 'I love this photo. emotive. even tones to set the scene of tranquility.. awesome work! you should be proud. Edit: My daughter''s (9 yrs old) interpretation... I like the sky. It looks like a time portal that is opening for the children.', '2003-02-13 18:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(214972, 12278, 806, '<td valign="top">deep within the cheese grater?! yikes! and all this time I was afraid of what might be under the bed!! :0) LOL<br/>Okay...<br/>interesting concept..the dark areas are a bit noisy. neat colors.. <br/> <br/>Edit: My daughter''s comments (9 yrs. old): Awesome! I like the red. It is my favorite color. It makes me feel like someone is staring at me. Good job.</td>', 'deep within the cheese grater?! yikes! and all this time I was afraid of what might be under the bed!! :0) LOLOkay...interesting concept..the dark areas are a bit noisy. neat colors..  Edit: My daughter''s comments (9 yrs. old): Awesome! I like the red. It is my favorite color. It makes me feel like someone is staring at me. Good job.', '2003-02-13 18:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(214986, 12161, 1379, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I, too, tried to incorporate the moon into my picture, but no luck.  Your sky is an amazing color!</td>', 'Lovely!  I, too, tried to incorporate the moon into my picture, but no luck.  Your sky is an amazing color!', '2003-02-13 19:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(214988, 12271, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very sweet portrait!  I like your choice of black and white.</td>', 'Very sweet portrait!  I like your choice of black and white.', '2003-02-13 19:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(214990, 12101, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  The rose border really adds to the delicacy of this scene.  I love it!!</td>', 'Great photo!  The rose border really adds to the delicacy of this scene.  I love it!!', '2003-02-13 19:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(214994, 12141, 3459, '<td valign="top">I think this is a winner this week, everything about it is perfect (the colours, tonal range, focus, composition).  Might''ve been a good enterence for the current Rythm challenge.  A 10!</td>', 'I think this is a winner this week, everything about it is perfect (the colours, tonal range, focus, composition).  Might''ve been a good enterence for the current Rythm challenge.  A 10!', '2003-02-13 19:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(214996, 12235, 1379, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and I love the color cast.</td>', 'Beautiful, and I love the color cast.', '2003-02-13 19:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(214999, 12299, 3459, '<td valign="top">One of the best composition I''ve seen on this site in a number of months that I''ve been a member, great tonal range, the sky is perfect.  Too bad we have to comply with the current size limits.  Great job, congrats!</td>', 'One of the best composition I''ve seen on this site in a number of months that I''ve been a member, great tonal range, the sky is perfect.  Too bad we have to comply with the current size limits.  Great job, congrats!', '2003-02-13 19:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215004, 12292, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well done "tatoo".  Color seems pretty good.  Framing works well enough, lighting too.  Challenge aspect - well, cute/funny, but IMHO not really as requested by the challenge.  Background - busy and not additive to subject.  Effort - relatively high.<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Well done "tatoo".  Color seems pretty good.  Framing works well enough, lighting too.  Challenge aspect - well, cute/funny, but IMHO not really as requested by the challenge.  Background - busy and not additive to subject.  Effort - relatively high.7 Swash', '2003-02-13 19:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(215005, 12149, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  Extremely clear, even though white on white, well done!  Challenge aspect - I''m just not certain how this fits, but I''m not wholly cruel, so I won''t nail you HARD for that (and my ignorance of the subject).  Very detailed!<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Very good photo.  Extremely clear, even though white on white, well done!  Challenge aspect - I''m just not certain how this fits, but I''m not wholly cruel, so I won''t nail you HARD for that (and my ignorance of the subject).  Very detailed!7 Swash', '2003-02-13 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(215006, 12307, 1005, '<td valign="top">Comment didn''t stick  -  Good photo!  Nice color, good focus, framing - well, I''ll go personal taste there.  Lighting - while it seems bright would be needed to light the degree tags, the glare is a bit harsh.  The curvature of the glass distorts the image, but I''m not certain if that''s a good thing or a bad thing (no score affect).<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Comment didn''t stick  -  Good photo!  Nice color, good focus, framing - well, I''ll go personal taste there.  Lighting - while it seems bright would be needed to light the degree tags, the glare is a bit harsh.  The curvature of the glass distorts the image, but I''m not certain if that''s a good thing or a bad thing (no score affect).7 Swash', '2003-02-13 19:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(215007, 12201, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot, but a little dark.  Challenge - I''ll buy it.  Interest level - moderate.  My eyes keep being drawn to the light at the top of the wall (Not certain if this is a good thing or not, but I don''t think so.....On the other hand, it is kinda out of your control...got a sling shot?  7 Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot, but a little dark.  Challenge - I''ll buy it.  Interest level - moderate.  My eyes keep being drawn to the light at the top of the wall (Not certain if this is a good thing or not, but I don''t think so.....On the other hand, it is kinda out of your control...got a sling shot?  7 Swash', '2003-02-13 19:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(215009, 12263, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, well contrasted shot.  Pretty model!  Nice framing.  Challenge aspect - I''m not certain I get it....viewing up at her??  (let''s just not push this too much, I''ll give you back the point I took away for my not understanding!)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp, well contrasted shot.  Pretty model!  Nice framing.  Challenge aspect - I''m not certain I get it....viewing up at her??  (let''s just not push this too much, I''ll give you back the point I took away for my not understanding!)  8 Swash', '2003-02-13 19:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215010, 12257, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot.  Strong focus and very good color.  Challenge - well met.  Interest - mederate.  Detail - good.  Framing - O.K.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good perspective shot.  Strong focus and very good color.  Challenge - well met.  Interest - mederate.  Detail - good.  Framing - O.K.  8 Swash', '2003-02-13 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(215011, 12188, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot, but maybe just a little tight on the angle.  Colr seems very good.  Focus is good.  Framing - seems O.K. to me.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good perspective shot, but maybe just a little tight on the angle.  Colr seems very good.  Focus is good.  Framing - seems O.K. to me.  8 Swash', '2003-02-13 20:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(215012, 12302, 1005, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Very postcard-ish.  IMHO, the best of the challenge and my only 10.  Color is outstanding!  Framing is very good.  Focus - very sharp.  I like the cows meandering in the frame with their shadows.  The windmills on the top of the hill, very, very nice!  Nice contrasts.  Did I say this was a 10?  Swash</td>', 'WOW!  Very postcard-ish.  IMHO, the best of the challenge and my only 10.  Color is outstanding!  Framing is very good.  Focus - very sharp.  I like the cows meandering in the frame with their shadows.  The windmills on the top of the hill, very, very nice!  Nice contrasts.  Did I say this was a 10?  Swash', '2003-02-13 20:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215099, 12204, 772, '<td valign="top">great perspective and the color is excellent.. .great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'great perspective and the color is excellent.. .great shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-13 23:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(215181, 12299, 6087, '<td valign="top">awesome picture!</td>', 'awesome picture!', '2003-02-14 01:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215213, 12299, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo. Because it is so good, the only things i''ll say in this comment are small nit-picky things.<br/> <br/>I think the children should be centred. I think this would help the composition more than them being slightly to the right. I''m also not so keen on the washed out white area on the right.<br/> <br/>I think overall this needs just a little more contrast throughout the photo, to add to the high dramatic feeling this photo already gives.<br/> <br/>Changing these small things would get you an 11 if such a thing were available, but have a 10 for now.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo. Because it is so good, the only things i''ll say in this comment are small nit-picky things. I think the children should be centred. I think this would help the composition more than them being slightly to the right. I''m also not so keen on the washed out white area on the right. I think overall this needs just a little more contrast throughout the photo, to add to the high dramatic feeling this photo already gives. Changing these small things would get you an 11 if such a thing were available, but have a 10 for now.', '2003-02-14 02:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(215214, 12235, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective here, it makes the columns looks very intimidating. Nice and sharp, and the blue colouring works really well. If only you could spot-edit out that chip on the leftmost column this would be even better. 10</td>', 'Nice perspective here, it makes the columns looks very intimidating. Nice and sharp, and the blue colouring works really well. If only you could spot-edit out that chip on the leftmost column this would be even better. 10', '2003-02-14 02:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215215, 12118, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot. I like the leading lines, and the sharpness of the photo is great. I like the choice of sepia too. It''s unfortunate that the sky was overcast that day, but still a 10</td>', 'Great perspective shot. I like the leading lines, and the sharpness of the photo is great. I like the choice of sepia too. It''s unfortunate that the sky was overcast that day, but still a 10', '2003-02-14 02:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(215216, 12126, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Good perspective. I like all the angles leading into one point, it looks very effective within the good composition. The one thing that would get this photo from a 9 to a 10 in my opinion, would maybe be to move to a slightly different vantage point, so those circular reflections in the bottom right werent visible, because I think they take away from the nice angular photo. 9</td>', 'I really like this. Good perspective. I like all the angles leading into one point, it looks very effective within the good composition. The one thing that would get this photo from a 9 to a 10 in my opinion, would maybe be to move to a slightly different vantage point, so those circular reflections in the bottom right werent visible, because I think they take away from the nice angular photo. 9', '2003-02-14 02:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(215218, 12213, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is great... Must have taken a long time to set up! I like the way you put other dominos around the place to add some interest elsewhere in the photo. They also help to show that distance of the perspective, which is great. 9</td>', 'This is great... Must have taken a long time to set up! I like the way you put other dominos around the place to add some interest elsewhere in the photo. They also help to show that distance of the perspective, which is great. 9', '2003-02-14 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(215220, 12248, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. The tree on the right adds some nice framing, and the nice bright colours look very nice. It is a shame about the shadow of the tree over the front headstones, but the pattern that they all create looks nice and it shows perspective well. 9</td>', 'Very nicely composed. The tree on the right adds some nice framing, and the nice bright colours look very nice. It is a shame about the shadow of the tree over the front headstones, but the pattern that they all create looks nice and it shows perspective well. 9', '2003-02-14 02:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(215221, 12176, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this angle. It''s not the best to show the actual height of the buildings against the tree but it is unique and interesting. I like this photo a lot.<br/> <br/>Just as an end note, I think the fact that the inside border is almost the same colour as the sky is a bit distracting, because it makes the branches of the tree appear to just cut off.<br/> <br/>I gave this photo a 9.</td>', 'I really like this angle. It''s not the best to show the actual height of the buildings against the tree but it is unique and interesting. I like this photo a lot. Just as an end note, I think the fact that the inside border is almost the same colour as the sky is a bit distracting, because it makes the branches of the tree appear to just cut off. I gave this photo a 9.', '2003-02-14 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(215222, 12201, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective here but I really think it needs some contrast added in your editing program to really bring out the shadows nicely. 8.</td>', 'I like the perspective here but I really think it needs some contrast added in your editing program to really bring out the shadows nicely. 8.', '2003-02-14 02:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(215223, 12268, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. The composition placement seems very good, and the curve of the ground leads the eye well. I think however it could do with a sharpen in a graphics editing program, because to me it looks a bit blurred. Also, the columns seem to be tilting to the left which is a little distracting. 7</td>', 'I like this shot. The composition placement seems very good, and the curve of the ground leads the eye well. I think however it could do with a sharpen in a graphics editing program, because to me it looks a bit blurred. Also, the columns seem to be tilting to the left which is a little distracting. 7', '2003-02-14 02:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215231, 12268, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat, but the composition doesn''t quite seem right to me. It feels too upright with a vague curve off into the distance on the left. If you''d gotten a better angle so you can just see pillars sweeping off into the distance, and cut out the steps and wall on the right, it might have had more impact.</td>', 'Neat, but the composition doesn''t quite seem right to me. It feels too upright with a vague curve off into the distance on the left. If you''d gotten a better angle so you can just see pillars sweeping off into the distance, and cut out the steps and wall on the right, it might have had more impact.', '2003-02-14 03:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(215233, 12149, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like photos that are this big on my screen. It''s hard to take them all in.<br/> <br/>Technically, this photo is great. I can see all the textures and patterns in the shot. The lighting is gorgeous and there''s great tonal depth. Thematically, though, it does nothing for me and I''m not sure if it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I really don''t like photos that are this big on my screen. It''s hard to take them all in. Technically, this photo is great. I can see all the textures and patterns in the shot. The lighting is gorgeous and there''s great tonal depth. Thematically, though, it does nothing for me and I''m not sure if it meets the challenge.', '2003-02-14 04:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215234, 12282, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is cool, the corners have this odd optical illusion type effect. I don''t really like the colours though. Yellow, orange and brown! A little work on the hue could have brought out the red tones more, maybe.<br/> <br/>Oooh, yes, I just tried it, and if you turn the hue towards the red end, it turns a really lovely deep orange with darker browns.</td>', 'This is cool, the corners have this odd optical illusion type effect. I don''t really like the colours though. Yellow, orange and brown! A little work on the hue could have brought out the red tones more, maybe. Oooh, yes, I just tried it, and if you turn the hue towards the red end, it turns a really lovely deep orange with darker browns.', '2003-02-14 04:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(215236, 12223, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overexposed. The blue sky is overwhelmingly blue against the white bark, which doesn''t show all its details because of overexposure. I''m not sure that you achieved what you wanted to with this photo, although the patterns of the branches and twigs in the sky are lovely.</td>', 'Seems a bit overexposed. The blue sky is overwhelmingly blue against the white bark, which doesn''t show all its details because of overexposure. I''m not sure that you achieved what you wanted to with this photo, although the patterns of the branches and twigs in the sky are lovely.', '2003-02-14 04:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(215237, 12132, 1037, '<td valign="top">Weird and cool. I''m not sure how well it meets the challenge, but I love the way that vase shines out from the darkness as though it''s hovering there in mid air.</td>', 'Weird and cool. I''m not sure how well it meets the challenge, but I love the way that vase shines out from the darkness as though it''s hovering there in mid air.', '2003-02-14 04:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(215239, 12143, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but it lacks tonal depth. Some work on the contrast or playing with the levels in photoshop would have brought this up really well. My monitor is calibrated to see all the squares on the voting page, so you have to use that full range for me to see depth in a photo and prevent it looking washed out.</td>', 'Cool shot, but it lacks tonal depth. Some work on the contrast or playing with the levels in photoshop would have brought this up really well. My monitor is calibrated to see all the squares on the voting page, so you have to use that full range for me to see depth in a photo and prevent it looking washed out.', '2003-02-14 04:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(215241, 12231, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is awkward. Having something come right from the corner is generally a no-no, unless you have a really good reason to break that rule. The colours seem a bit greyish and the monument is overexposed at the top. There are a lot of photos similar to this one in the challenge, so it''s hard not to compare them and see that yours is lacking a little bit in colour and composition.</td>', 'The composition of this is awkward. Having something come right from the corner is generally a no-no, unless you have a really good reason to break that rule. The colours seem a bit greyish and the monument is overexposed at the top. There are a lot of photos similar to this one in the challenge, so it''s hard not to compare them and see that yours is lacking a little bit in colour and composition.', '2003-02-14 04:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215243, 12206, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is neat. It''s a busy photo, but those red lines really tie it all together and give your eyes something to focus on. Interesting and different and creative.</td>', 'This is neat. It''s a busy photo, but those red lines really tie it all together and give your eyes something to focus on. Interesting and different and creative.', '2003-02-14 04:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(215250, 12277, 4430, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and angle. You might''ve cropped it a little more toward the moon to get that a little more in the picture.  Nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Great lighting and angle. You might''ve cropped it a little more toward the moon to get that a little more in the picture.  Nice shot nonetheless', '2003-02-14 04:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215252, 12188, 4430, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how white the sky is.  Some cool rocks though and I do feel this was taken from a good perspective as well.  Great DOF</td>', 'I don''t like how white the sky is.  Some cool rocks though and I do feel this was taken from a good perspective as well.  Great DOF', '2003-02-14 04:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(215254, 12268, 4430, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Nice warm colors, good interesting subject.</td>', 'Excellent.  Nice warm colors, good interesting subject.', '2003-02-14 04:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215257, 12139, 4430, '<td valign="top">I like the picture a lot except for the bright white sky.  The colors of the brick are really unique.  The angle this picture was shot at is excellent.</td>', 'I like the picture a lot except for the bright white sky.  The colors of the brick are really unique.  The angle this picture was shot at is excellent.', '2003-02-14 05:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(215270, 12268, 1863, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, I like how your eye is drawn and you just want to go turn the corner to see what''s there. The trees in the background make it even more interesting in my opinion, and give more perspective. Well done. 10 -Annida</td>', 'Excellent work, I like how your eye is drawn and you just want to go turn the corner to see what''s there. The trees in the background make it even more interesting in my opinion, and give more perspective. Well done. 10 -Annida', '2003-02-14 06:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(215271, 12271, 1863, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Excellent depth of field, nice tight crop. I can see his feet, and his whole face seems perfectly in focus. Lovely 10 -Annida</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Excellent depth of field, nice tight crop. I can see his feet, and his whole face seems perfectly in focus. Lovely 10 -Annida', '2003-02-14 06:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(215272, 12118, 1863, '<td valign="top">I love how your eyes are drawn toward the back of the photo by the bright light in the center, and the row of trees. Very clever shot. The front right is well done as well, as that curve also draws you in. Good take on the challenge. 10 -Annida</td>', 'I love how your eyes are drawn toward the back of the photo by the bright light in the center, and the row of trees. Very clever shot. The front right is well done as well, as that curve also draws you in. Good take on the challenge. 10 -Annida', '2003-02-14 06:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(215273, 12235, 1863, '<td valign="top">Greek columns, I am partial to this being greek :)  Your use of low saturation is very clever, and the lighting works. The shadow of the leaves on the column lets you imagine where they are situated, and your eyes are certainly drawn up to the top. Very good image, good DOF. 10 -Annida</td>', 'Greek columns, I am partial to this being greek :)  Your use of low saturation is very clever, and the lighting works. The shadow of the leaves on the column lets you imagine where they are situated, and your eyes are certainly drawn up to the top. Very good image, good DOF. 10 -Annida', '2003-02-14 06:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(215319, 12146, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love the visual impace the strong colouring gives, and the composition leads the eye really well to the centre. It does seem to me that the centre could be a little sharper however, but still a good strong 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I love the visual impace the strong colouring gives, and the composition leads the eye really well to the centre. It does seem to me that the centre could be a little sharper however, but still a good strong 10.', '2003-02-14 10:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215320, 12238, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful in black and white.  Nice job!  I love the shadows leading your eyes up the stairs.  Excellent use of composition, leading lines, and great perspective.  Perfect -10-  Talya</td>', 'This is beautiful in black and white.  Nice job!  I love the shadows leading your eyes up the stairs.  Excellent use of composition, leading lines, and great perspective.  Perfect -10-  Talya', '2003-02-14 10:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(215323, 12213, 2764, '<td valign="top">You added too much - change it to black and white, take away all the extra dominos and you have a blue ribbon!</td>', 'You added too much - change it to black and white, take away all the extra dominos and you have a blue ribbon!', '2003-02-14 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215331, 12227, 2764, '<td valign="top">Someone recently posted some tips on how to choose which pciture to submit.  One tip was something like : If it has writing, maake sure we can read it.  It drives humans crazy not to be able to tell what it says-  This is going to lose you points in an otherwise stunning picture.</td>', 'Someone recently posted some tips on how to choose which pciture to submit.  One tip was something like : If it has writing, maake sure we can read it.  It drives humans crazy not to be able to tell what it says-  This is going to lose you points in an otherwise stunning picture.', '2003-02-14 10:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215347, 12141, 2764, '<td valign="top">Escher WOW</td>', 'Escher WOW', '2003-02-14 11:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(215399, 12084, 2764, '<td valign="top">extra points becasue I can recognize all the buildings</td>', 'extra points becasue I can recognize all the buildings', '2003-02-14 13:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215405, 12149, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus, and the coloring works well here!  Nicely done</td>', 'Great focus, and the coloring works well here!  Nicely done', '2003-02-14 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215406, 12238, 811, '<td valign="top">Very graceful curves.  I think cropping it at the landing so that the "curve" is not interrupted, and making it extend slightly right would have looked really nice to.</td>', 'Very graceful curves.  I think cropping it at the landing so that the "curve" is not interrupted, and making it extend slightly right would have looked really nice to.', '2003-02-14 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(215453, 12272, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot.  Central focus area is very clear/sharp.  Good title.  Interest level is moderate (but that''s just me).  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice perspective shot.  Central focus area is very clear/sharp.  Good title.  Interest level is moderate (but that''s just me).  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(215454, 12310, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat effect!  I''m wondering how you did this, but it''s pretty cool!  (Maybe a special mirror?)  Focus is very sharp, very detailed shot.  Interest is moderate to high, good humor!  The left side is a tad bit over-exposed, but otherwise good lighting. <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Neat effect!  I''m wondering how you did this, but it''s pretty cool!  (Maybe a special mirror?)  Focus is very sharp, very detailed shot.  Interest is moderate to high, good humor!  The left side is a tad bit over-exposed, but otherwise good lighting. 8 Swash', '2003-02-14 15:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215455, 12308, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo.  Color seem very good, too.  It works as a perspective shot, challenge met.  My only nit is the sunflares on the left edge.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo.  Color seem very good, too.  It works as a perspective shot, challenge met.  My only nit is the sunflares on the left edge.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(215458, 12235, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective shot!  Focus is sharp, good amount of contrasts.  Interest - pretty good, it''s a dramatic view, I like it!  Score bump!  from 8 to 9!  Swash</td>', 'Very nice perspective shot!  Focus is sharp, good amount of contrasts.  Interest - pretty good, it''s a dramatic view, I like it!  Score bump!  from 8 to 9!  Swash', '2003-02-14 15:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(215461, 12060, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot!  This seems like a bit of an odd perspective, but it works for me.  I don''t remember seeing a push propeller bomber, must be a McDonald Douglas product (I work for Boeing, he he)  Colro seems a tad low, esp. the yellow on the prop tips (a little washed out?)  Otherwise, this is a very fine photo!  8 Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot!  This seems like a bit of an odd perspective, but it works for me.  I don''t remember seeing a push propeller bomber, must be a McDonald Douglas product (I work for Boeing, he he)  Colro seems a tad low, esp. the yellow on the prop tips (a little washed out?)  Otherwise, this is a very fine photo!  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(215464, 12118, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Sepia (it is Sepia, right?) seems very correct and effective here.  Focus appears good, lighting works.  Challenge well met.  I feel another score bump coming!  (I''m overcoming a bias on non-color photos!)  from 8 to 9!!  Swash</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Sepia (it is Sepia, right?) seems very correct and effective here.  Focus appears good, lighting works.  Challenge well met.  I feel another score bump coming!  (I''m overcoming a bias on non-color photos!)  from 8 to 9!!  Swash', '2003-02-14 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(215477, 12235, 2690, '<td valign="top">very nice prespective. a little heavy on the contrast but still a great shot</td>', 'very nice prespective. a little heavy on the contrast but still a great shot', '2003-02-14 15:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(215479, 12118, 2690, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, would have been nice in color too...</td>', 'very nice shot, would have been nice in color too...', '2003-02-14 15:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(215480, 12238, 2690, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, very abstract. just not enough prespective to make it for me..</td>', 'I like this shot, very abstract. just not enough prespective to make it for me..', '2003-02-14 15:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(215481, 12290, 2690, '<td valign="top">Colors and contrast are top notch.</td>', 'Colors and contrast are top notch.', '2003-02-14 15:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215482, 12126, 2690, '<td valign="top">very intresting shot. works well in black and white. prespective is also nice</td>', 'very intresting shot. works well in black and white. prespective is also nice', '2003-02-14 15:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(215483, 12206, 2690, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. to bad its not spring or summer or fall, anything but winter would have made this a much more intresting shot! not that its a bad shot...</td>', 'Nice shot. to bad its not spring or summer or fall, anything but winter would have made this a much more intresting shot! not that its a bad shot...', '2003-02-14 15:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215486, 12304, 2690, '<td valign="top">nice shot, color and prespective came out very well.</td>', 'nice shot, color and prespective came out very well.', '2003-02-14 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(215487, 12101, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the nostalgia this picture depicts.  Great framing.  Was the little one at the end needing "to go?"  hehe.</td>', 'I love the nostalgia this picture depicts.  Great framing.  Was the little one at the end needing "to go?"  hehe.', '2003-02-14 15:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215488, 12176, 2690, '<td valign="top">I think the two buildings really help this shot. made it a little better than the other tree pics. I wonder how it would have looked with a blue sky?<br/> <br/>nice shooting tex</td>', 'I think the two buildings really help this shot. made it a little better than the other tree pics. I wonder how it would have looked with a blue sky? nice shooting tex', '2003-02-14 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(215489, 12149, 2690, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot, I just dont think it meets the challenge im MHO.</td>', 'this is a nice shot, I just dont think it meets the challenge im MHO.', '2003-02-14 15:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(215492, 12056, 2690, '<td valign="top">you have an intresting shot. maybe if you had stepped to the right just a bit. also it hs very strangely contrasted, very distracting. A little over processed in post.<br/>the focus of it seems to be on the first tree, might have worked better if there were a better vanishing point...<br/>better than some, not as good as others...<br/>not a bad concept..</td>', 'you have an intresting shot. maybe if you had stepped to the right just a bit. also it hs very strangely contrasted, very distracting. A little over processed in post.the focus of it seems to be on the first tree, might have worked better if there were a better vanishing point...better than some, not as good as others...not a bad concept..', '2003-02-14 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215493, 12192, 2690, '<td valign="top">intresting view, looks like the tiny streets in germany or france. LOL<br/>I think this shot could use a little color adjustment, would have liked to see more contrast...everything is a little washed out.</td>', 'intresting view, looks like the tiny streets in germany or france. LOLI think this shot could use a little color adjustment, would have liked to see more contrast...everything is a little washed out.', '2003-02-14 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215498, 12305, 811, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful.  Hope the camera stayed dried!!  Great idea, and wonderful execution.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful.  Hope the camera stayed dried!!  Great idea, and wonderful execution.', '2003-02-14 16:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215501, 12271, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus and depth of field!!</td>', 'Great focus and depth of field!!', '2003-02-14 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215502, 12285, 2000, '<td valign="top">The Depth of Field here seems a bit shallow - the nose (?) of the snake is out of focus, and it doesn''t look like it should be.  I like the rest of the photo, especially the level of clarity of the snake''s scales.</td>', 'The Depth of Field here seems a bit shallow - the nose (?) of the snake is out of focus, and it doesn''t look like it should be.  I like the rest of the photo, especially the level of clarity of the snake''s scales.', '2003-02-14 16:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215511, 12288, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective shot.  Focus is good, lighting seems about right, color - hard to say, but I''ll go with it.  Interest - well, there''s the rub...I''m not terribly fond of run down/old buildings, but I''ll try to not let that sway my score.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very good perspective shot.  Focus is good, lighting seems about right, color - hard to say, but I''ll go with it.  Interest - well, there''s the rub...I''m not terribly fond of run down/old buildings, but I''ll try to not let that sway my score.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215512, 12174, 2000, '<td valign="top">I saw this one I think on your camera screen, but i still like it.  The tree breaks up the monotony.</td>', 'I saw this one I think on your camera screen, but i still like it.  The tree breaks up the monotony.', '2003-02-14 17:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(215514, 12248, 2000, '<td valign="top">Must be an ''official'' cemetary, but obviously not Arlington.  Where''s this taken?</td>', 'Must be an ''official'' cemetary, but obviously not Arlington.  Where''s this taken?', '2003-02-14 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(215515, 12290, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, very clear shot with a good perspective subject (might work well for the Rythme challenge too).  Color - the blue seems a little too saturated (too dark to be real), but that also may be a result of window tinting (well, it could!).  You picked an interesting, but slightly difficult angle to view (still, it works for me).  Did you de-staturate the bricks, or were they really this grey? (just asking, not a score issue)<br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Wow, very clear shot with a good perspective subject (might work well for the Rythme challenge too).  Color - the blue seems a little too saturated (too dark to be real), but that also may be a result of window tinting (well, it could!).  You picked an interesting, but slightly difficult angle to view (still, it works for me).  Did you de-staturate the bricks, or were they really this grey? (just asking, not a score issue)8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(215517, 12108, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very strong image.  Color seems very good.  I''m not totally certain about how this relates to this challenge, but I''ll not argue too much (I''ve been looking at so many high angle shots, this seems like a refreshing change).  I don''t understand your title, but that''s nothing to do with your score either.  (If you care to PM me, I''d be fine with that!)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very strong image.  Color seems very good.  I''m not totally certain about how this relates to this challenge, but I''ll not argue too much (I''ve been looking at so many high angle shots, this seems like a refreshing change).  I don''t understand your title, but that''s nothing to do with your score either.  (If you care to PM me, I''d be fine with that!)  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215518, 12243, 1005, '<td valign="top">Strong angle shot!  Challenge well met.  Framing works for me.  Focus seems pretty good.  I always like a little bit of foreground material in scenery shots, so I like that tuft of grass in the lower right corner, nich touch.  8 Swash</td>', 'Strong angle shot!  Challenge well met.  Framing works for me.  Focus seems pretty good.  I always like a little bit of foreground material in scenery shots, so I like that tuft of grass in the lower right corner, nich touch.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(215522, 12293, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice high angle shot.  Challenge well met.  Color - well the flag seems very nice, too bad you can''t control the weather (love a blue sky with this one, no score effect)  Focus is nicely sharp.  Framing - I can see why you chopped the flag, but cropping it partly still doesn''t seem like a "good" thing (ala Martha Stewart). <br/>Overall, a very nice effort, easily an 8.  Swash</td>', 'Nice high angle shot.  Challenge well met.  Color - well the flag seems very nice, too bad you can''t control the weather (love a blue sky with this one, no score effect)  Focus is nicely sharp.  Framing - I can see why you chopped the flag, but cropping it partly still doesn''t seem like a "good" thing (ala Martha Stewart). Overall, a very nice effort, easily an 8.  Swash', '2003-02-14 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(215527, 12204, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, I just finished commenting on a very similar pic (No, not cliche - great minds think alike!!)  Your shot is better as you didn''t crop off part of the flag and you were lucky enough to order (and get) a very nice blue sky.  The moon is a very nice touch, glad you were able to leave it in.  Focus seems very good.  (I can see the flag needs replacing - starting to tatter!)  Framing is very good.  Lighting works well, I can live with the shadow across part of the flag.  9 Swash</td>', 'Wow, I just finished commenting on a very similar pic (No, not cliche - great minds think alike!!)  Your shot is better as you didn''t crop off part of the flag and you were lucky enough to order (and get) a very nice blue sky.  The moon is a very nice touch, glad you were able to leave it in.  Focus seems very good.  (I can see the flag needs replacing - starting to tatter!)  Framing is very good.  Lighting works well, I can live with the shadow across part of the flag.  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(215530, 12161, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Challenge well met.  The inclusion of the moon is a nice touch.  Beautiful blue skys (just like you asked for!).  Focus seems pretty good, but it seems a tad (really just a tad) off.  Color - pretty, but unless I''m grossly mistaken, the red value seems a tad high, the trunk is more red than brown, as do the dead palm leaves.  Still, overall a very nice image.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo!  Challenge well met.  The inclusion of the moon is a nice touch.  Beautiful blue skys (just like you asked for!).  Focus seems pretty good, but it seems a tad (really just a tad) off.  Color - pretty, but unless I''m grossly mistaken, the red value seems a tad high, the trunk is more red than brown, as do the dead palm leaves.  Still, overall a very nice image.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215531, 12207, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective shot.  Challenge well met.  Color seem pretty good, but w/o a point of reference, hard to really say other than, I like the colors of this photo.  Framing/crop - You got most of it (chopped the beginning e a little bit).  Interest - moderate, nothing really draws me in, inviting me to stay and look more.  Still, overall this is a very nice photo.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very good perspective shot.  Challenge well met.  Color seem pretty good, but w/o a point of reference, hard to really say other than, I like the colors of this photo.  Framing/crop - You got most of it (chopped the beginning e a little bit).  Interest - moderate, nothing really draws me in, inviting me to stay and look more.  Still, overall this is a very nice photo.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(215533, 12146, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot.  I like the starring of the two farther lights and wonder why the closer one didn''t do it, too.  Lighting - a tad dark, but probably best for this subject  (is that waldo at the end of the tunnel, standing in the darkness?  joke)  Color - honestly hard to say, no frame of reference, but it looks pretty good.  Focus - also seems pretty good.  Interest - moderate, nothing dramatic or really eye catchy, but not totally boring either.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good perspective shot.  I like the starring of the two farther lights and wonder why the closer one didn''t do it, too.  Lighting - a tad dark, but probably best for this subject  (is that waldo at the end of the tunnel, standing in the darkness?  joke)  Color - honestly hard to say, no frame of reference, but it looks pretty good.  Focus - also seems pretty good.  Interest - moderate, nothing dramatic or really eye catchy, but not totally boring either.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(215534, 12126, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good perspectives shot.  I like the slight blur of the third elevator car, adds to the interest, but the focus is really good as the rest of the cars are solid as rocks!!  Contrast - pretty good, nice range of dark to white.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good perspectives shot.  I like the slight blur of the third elevator car, adds to the interest, but the focus is really good as the rest of the cars are solid as rocks!!  Contrast - pretty good, nice range of dark to white.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(215535, 12272, 2000, '<td valign="top">Are the turretts (?) on the fence the guardians?  They look similar to Chess Pawns, which I guess do serve that function.  I think that black void should have been taken into account for the shooting angle here, as it kind of detracts in my view.</td>', 'Are the turretts (?) on the fence the guardians?  They look similar to Chess Pawns, which I guess do serve that function.  I think that black void should have been taken into account for the shooting angle here, as it kind of detracts in my view.', '2003-02-14 17:32:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(215536, 12289, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot!  Color seems very good.  Framing is very nice.  The inclusion of the moon is a nice touch.  Focus - seems pretty good, but....the flag is fuzzy.  You might have done this on purpose to show movement (flag waving) or you might have needed a faster shutter speed (w/o descriptions, this is always a hard one to judge/guess).  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice perspective shot!  Color seems very good.  Framing is very nice.  The inclusion of the moon is a nice touch.  Focus - seems pretty good, but....the flag is fuzzy.  You might have done this on purpose to show movement (flag waving) or you might have needed a faster shutter speed (w/o descriptions, this is always a hard one to judge/guess).  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215537, 12260, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess so!  Good perspective shot.  Framing is good, oooh, while commenting, I tried a little different crop that I really like better where the top is cropped just below the horizon (flat pic like this, that works really well)  I think the buildings are not needed, but seeing the tracks disappear at the edge of the frame seems more exciting to me (more infinate).  Focus is very strong.  Color - well, the rust looks like rust, so it''s good, too.  Easy 8  -  Swash</td>', 'Well, I guess so!  Good perspective shot.  Framing is good, oooh, while commenting, I tried a little different crop that I really like better where the top is cropped just below the horizon (flat pic like this, that works really well)  I think the buildings are not needed, but seeing the tracks disappear at the edge of the frame seems more exciting to me (more infinate).  Focus is very strong.  Color - well, the rust looks like rust, so it''s good, too.  Easy 8  -  Swash', '2003-02-14 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(215538, 12206, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot.  All the chrome with the red is very pretty/striking.  Framing - looks good to me!  Color - I don''t see anything wrong/bad there either.  Focus - seems perfect to me.  The sun flares in the chrome aren''t really bad, but I''ve never met a flare that I truly liked.  Interest - moderate to high, mostly due to the chrome and red.  8 Swash</td>', 'Good perspective shot.  All the chrome with the red is very pretty/striking.  Framing - looks good to me!  Color - I don''t see anything wrong/bad there either.  Focus - seems perfect to me.  The sun flares in the chrome aren''t really bad, but I''ve never met a flare that I truly liked.  Interest - moderate to high, mostly due to the chrome and red.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215539, 12231, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat structure!  Challenge well met.  I like foreground "stuff" in landscape shots, this is no exception.  Color - blue seems a tad grey (what time of day was it?), but otherwise,really nice.  Framing - I dunno, it works for me!  8 Swash</td>', 'Neat structure!  Challenge well met.  I like foreground "stuff" in landscape shots, this is no exception.  Color - blue seems a tad grey (what time of day was it?), but otherwise,really nice.  Framing - I dunno, it works for me!  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215551, 12052, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot!  Nice trick (I think...is this a printed face w/ the real toothbrush in front?  But the face seems a little stretched??)  Good color.  Nice framing.  Focus is perfect.  (maybe a little closer shave? Joke!!)  Very good!!  9 Swash</td>', 'Very cute shot!  Nice trick (I think...is this a printed face w/ the real toothbrush in front?  But the face seems a little stretched??)  Good color.  Nice framing.  Focus is perfect.  (maybe a little closer shave? Joke!!)  Very good!!  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215552, 12174, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  The shadows on the snow with the gravestones is very, very nice!!  Color seems good.  Focus is perfect.  Nice emotional shot.  9 Swash</td>', 'I really like this!  The shadows on the snow with the gravestones is very, very nice!!  Color seems good.  Focus is perfect.  Nice emotional shot.  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 18:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215554, 12305, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot!  (Camera in a glass bucket?)  Very clear shot.  Good color!!  Framing works well.  Very cute!  9 Swash</td>', 'Really cool shot!  (Camera in a glass bucket?)  Very clear shot.  Good color!!  Framing works well.  Very cute!  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 18:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215555, 12109, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  This kinda tugs at my heart strings.  From the thumb, I thought the blue wrap was a coat! (even cooler idea!)  The flowers are very nice.  Very good color.  Good emotional appeal.  Framing works well.  I''m not really crazy about the far background, but that''s being a little picky (IMO).  Easy 9!  Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot.  This kinda tugs at my heart strings.  From the thumb, I thought the blue wrap was a coat! (even cooler idea!)  The flowers are very nice.  Very good color.  Good emotional appeal.  Framing works well.  I''m not really crazy about the far background, but that''s being a little picky (IMO).  Easy 9!  Swash', '2003-02-14 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(215556, 12301, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is so very cool!  I''m not exactly certain how this fits this challenge, but I''m not going to argue it.  Color seems very good.  Framing - O.K., but I don''t have any great suggestions.  Subject - extremely cool!  Interest - see subject.  9 Swash</td>', 'This is so very cool!  I''m not exactly certain how this fits this challenge, but I''m not going to argue it.  Color seems very good.  Framing - O.K., but I don''t have any great suggestions.  Subject - extremely cool!  Interest - see subject.  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(215557, 12185, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better perspective images in the challenge.  That pier seems to go on and on, to infinity!!!  I really like the bridge in the far background.  Could you make the smog/haze go away???  (Just kidding!)  Easy 9!!!  Swash</td>', 'This is one of the better perspective images in the challenge.  That pier seems to go on and on, to infinity!!!  I really like the bridge in the far background.  Could you make the smog/haze go away???  (Just kidding!)  Easy 9!!!  Swash', '2003-02-14 18:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(215558, 12202, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice piece!  Maybe a little short on the perspective side, but easily acceptable.  The deteriouration of the rail is interesting.  Contrast - I''d like just a little more, but this is workable.  Lighting - fine, except for the glare on the lower window.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice piece!  Maybe a little short on the perspective side, but easily acceptable.  The deteriouration of the rail is interesting.  Contrast - I''d like just a little more, but this is workable.  Lighting - fine, except for the glare on the lower window.  8 Swash', '2003-02-14 18:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(215560, 12277, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Perspective-wise, it works, but a more dramatic angle might have gotten the point across more strongly, but maybe you couldn''t get any closer!!  I do like the inclusion of the moon, nice touch and avoids the OPA issue.  Color seems good.  Framing - maybe a little more even crop of the pillar, but maybe that structure kept going, can''t tell from what I see.  Lighting - I like it very much, neat shadows.  9 Swash  (see, I really did like this piece!!)</td>', 'Very pretty.  Perspective-wise, it works, but a more dramatic angle might have gotten the point across more strongly, but maybe you couldn''t get any closer!!  I do like the inclusion of the moon, nice touch and avoids the OPA issue.  Color seems good.  Framing - maybe a little more even crop of the pillar, but maybe that structure kept going, can''t tell from what I see.  Lighting - I like it very much, neat shadows.  9 Swash  (see, I really did like this piece!!)', '2003-02-14 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215561, 12223, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Good perspective.  Color - very vibrant blues, the nearer birch bark seems a tad washed out, but it gets better farther away.  Focus - looks good to me!  Framing - while I see why you cut off the branches, it seems a shame to prune the tree (slight joke there)  Pretty pic!  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Good perspective.  Color - very vibrant blues, the nearer birch bark seems a tad washed out, but it gets better farther away.  Focus - looks good to me!  Framing - while I see why you cut off the branches, it seems a shame to prune the tree (slight joke there)  Pretty pic!  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 19:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215564, 12304, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot!  Color seem good.  Focus is right on.  Framing is near perfect.  Interest - very dramatic view, so that''s pretty high.  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice perspective shot!  Color seem good.  Focus is right on.  Framing is near perfect.  Interest - very dramatic view, so that''s pretty high.  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 19:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215567, 12084, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective shot.  I love these kinds of views.  Color - seems pretty good to me!  Focus - kinda n/a, but a sharp pic!  Framing - also n/a, this is one of those type shots that you could crop just about any way you wanted.  Interest - fairly high, like I said, I like this type of view.  9 Swash</td>', 'Cool perspective shot.  I love these kinds of views.  Color - seems pretty good to me!  Focus - kinda n/a, but a sharp pic!  Framing - also n/a, this is one of those type shots that you could crop just about any way you wanted.  Interest - fairly high, like I said, I like this type of view.  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 19:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215569, 12183, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Works well with this challenge.  Color - very good.  Framing - appealing.  Focus - seems pretty good, but the ppl are kinda far away to be really, really certain.  Overall a very nice shot.  9 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot!  Works well with this challenge.  Color - very good.  Framing - appealing.  Focus - seems pretty good, but the ppl are kinda far away to be really, really certain.  Overall a very nice shot.  9 Swash', '2003-02-14 19:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(215571, 12213, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  Good perspective shot!  Color is wonderful!  Focus is perfect!  Framing - kinda looks like you cut a few on the right, but overall, pretty good.  Interest - well, everybody loves action shots, though I might have liked it with a few more dominoes fallen down (not that I''m asking for the sun and the moon, just the moon!)  Easy 9 - Swash <br/>(I have a feeling you may win, this is THAT good of a shot.)</td>', 'Very, very nice.  Good perspective shot!  Color is wonderful!  Focus is perfect!  Framing - kinda looks like you cut a few on the right, but overall, pretty good.  Interest - well, everybody loves action shots, though I might have liked it with a few more dominoes fallen down (not that I''m asking for the sun and the moon, just the moon!)  Easy 9 - Swash (I have a feeling you may win, this is THAT good of a shot.)', '2003-02-14 19:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215574, 12159, 1005, '<td valign="top">This may be THE perfect flower picture.  Very, very nice!  Very nice details.  Color and contrast are wonderful.  Framing - I love it.  Challenge - a tad weak, but totally acceptable (maybe a longer stem????)  Very strong 9 Swash</td>', 'This may be THE perfect flower picture.  Very, very nice!  Very nice details.  Color and contrast are wonderful.  Framing - I love it.  Challenge - a tad weak, but totally acceptable (maybe a longer stem????)  Very strong 9 Swash', '2003-02-14 19:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215576, 12248, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Great perspective pic.  Color is vividly wonderful.  Framing - nice job!  Focus - also looks good to me!  Interest - strong emotional appeal, good job!  I can''t really tell you why this isn''t a 10, it certainly is an extremely strong 9 and very likely a ribbon shot!  I''m gonna stick with 9, but it sure is nice!!!  Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Great perspective pic.  Color is vividly wonderful.  Framing - nice job!  Focus - also looks good to me!  Interest - strong emotional appeal, good job!  I can''t really tell you why this isn''t a 10, it certainly is an extremely strong 9 and very likely a ribbon shot!  I''m gonna stick with 9, but it sure is nice!!!  Swash', '2003-02-14 19:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(215611, 12243, 6068, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot!', '2003-02-14 23:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215651, 12238, 5585, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.... Sharp... Great Focus...you can see the spots on the Carpet...sheesh..One of the top photos in this Challenge</td>', 'Very Nice.... Sharp... Great Focus...you can see the spots on the Carpet...sheesh..One of the top photos in this Challenge', '2003-02-15 00:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(215686, 12159, 5585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful....8</td>', 'Beautiful....8', '2003-02-15 01:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(215689, 12290, 5585, '<td valign="top">Very Nice...</td>', 'Very Nice...', '2003-02-15 01:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(215751, 12293, 1037, '<td valign="top">Regardless of how angry I am about world politics at the moment, this is a VERY good photo and right on topic. I can''t possibly let anti-war bias get in the way.</td>', 'Regardless of how angry I am about world politics at the moment, this is a VERY good photo and right on topic. I can''t possibly let anti-war bias get in the way.', '2003-02-15 04:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(215752, 12061, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this meets the perspective challenge. We''re seeing the world from the dog''s perspective? I guess that works. The reflections are a nice touch, but unofortunately there is nothing sharp enough or with a high enough impact to tie the photo together. The sign comes the closest, but it''s blurred. If there was more light on the dog or something, it may have worked.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this meets the perspective challenge. We''re seeing the world from the dog''s perspective? I guess that works. The reflections are a nice touch, but unofortunately there is nothing sharp enough or with a high enough impact to tie the photo together. The sign comes the closest, but it''s blurred. If there was more light on the dog or something, it may have worked.', '2003-02-15 04:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(215753, 12108, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really can''t find any way to judge this photo with respect to the challenge, but maybe that''s a cultural thing? I also don''t really like photos that are of something 2 dimensional from a perpendicular camera angle. This seems to break the rule on photographing a work of art in its entirety, although I''m sure it would be DQ''ed by now if others agreed with me.<br/> <br/>The composition is striking and thel ighting is good, but that''s about all I can say.</td>', 'I really can''t find any way to judge this photo with respect to the challenge, but maybe that''s a cultural thing? I also don''t really like photos that are of something 2 dimensional from a perpendicular camera angle. This seems to break the rule on photographing a work of art in its entirety, although I''m sure it would be DQ''ed by now if others agreed with me. The composition is striking and thel ighting is good, but that''s about all I can say.', '2003-02-15 04:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215754, 12165, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title. The photo is kind of nice. I like the blurring of the tree trunk bringing my eyes further up towards the branches. Overall, the composition is nice, and the light is decent. The colours are a little washed out.</td>', 'I don''t get the title. The photo is kind of nice. I like the blurring of the tree trunk bringing my eyes further up towards the branches. Overall, the composition is nice, and the light is decent. The colours are a little washed out.', '2003-02-15 04:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(215759, 12299, 5585, '<td valign="top">To Sandy...</td>', 'To Sandy...', '2003-02-15 05:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(215817, 12056, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the high contrast in this, and the twigs and branches all interlace into an amazing sense of texture. I''m giving this 10! I love it.</td>', 'I love the high contrast in this, and the twigs and branches all interlace into an amazing sense of texture. I''m giving this 10! I love it.', '2003-02-15 09:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(215820, 12305, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is just really, really cool. I love the colours, the cool distortion of the water, and the composition. 10!</td>', 'This is just really, really cool. I love the colours, the cool distortion of the water, and the composition. 10!', '2003-02-15 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(215823, 12109, 1037, '<td valign="top">Neat! Where is this? The composition is masterful. I love the way she looks down over the landscape in the background, from way up in the sky.</td>', 'Neat! Where is this? The composition is masterful. I love the way she looks down over the landscape in the background, from way up in the sky.', '2003-02-15 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215826, 12084, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool :). The architecture in that area is so strange and austere. I went there last July and had a great time. You were lucky to get such a great angle, and you composed it well. I love how the light strikes those buildings.</td>', 'Cool :). The architecture in that area is so strange and austere. I went there last July and had a great time. You were lucky to get such a great angle, and you composed it well. I love how the light strikes those buildings.', '2003-02-15 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(215828, 12176, 1037, '<td valign="top">OH! This is gorgeous. I have to give it 10.</td>', 'OH! This is gorgeous. I have to give it 10.', '2003-02-15 09:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(215831, 12192, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really, REALLY like the composition of this. It''s a great photo of street life that captures a real mood. It''s kind of soft (did you try sharpening it?) and the colours are muted. But on the whole I like it a lot. It''s just very, very well framed and well composed.</td>', 'I really, REALLY like the composition of this. It''s a great photo of street life that captures a real mood. It''s kind of soft (did you try sharpening it?) and the colours are muted. But on the whole I like it a lot. It''s just very, very well framed and well composed.', '2003-02-15 09:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215837, 12302, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and lovely composition. It''s hard to see how a lot of people think wind farms are visual pollution!</td>', 'Very nice colours and lovely composition. It''s hard to see how a lot of people think wind farms are visual pollution!', '2003-02-15 09:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(215839, 12101, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Brings back hideous memories! I love the grainy black and white, although the pink border kind of undermines it a bit. The composition is great.</td>', 'Pretty. Brings back hideous memories! I love the grainy black and white, although the pink border kind of undermines it a bit. The composition is great.', '2003-02-15 09:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215840, 12277, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and I love the shadows on this. Seems slightly pixellated, but that could be because of a low end camera.</td>', 'Nice composition, and I love the shadows on this. Seems slightly pixellated, but that could be because of a low end camera.', '2003-02-15 09:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(215841, 12245, 1037, '<td valign="top">A busy photo. All the trees distract from the fence, and the light is very bright. Perhaps if you had focussed more on the fence and not tried to frame the house in as well, you would have created a photo with more impact.</td>', 'A busy photo. All the trees distract from the fence, and the light is very bright. Perhaps if you had focussed more on the fence and not tried to frame the house in as well, you would have created a photo with more impact.', '2003-02-15 09:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(215843, 12141, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s really neat! Like an optical illusion. The light on the top set of stairs is a little harsh, but overall I really like it.</td>', 'That''s really neat! Like an optical illusion. The light on the top set of stairs is a little harsh, but overall I really like it.', '2003-02-15 09:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(215844, 12076, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is not as good, in my opinion, as the other American-flag-on-a-pole photo. It''s hard for me to judge this symbolism dispassionately, as I''m very opposed to the looming war (and I''m not American). But you caught the flag riding the wind very nicely.</td>', 'This is not as good, in my opinion, as the other American-flag-on-a-pole photo. It''s hard for me to judge this symbolism dispassionately, as I''m very opposed to the looming war (and I''m not American). But you caught the flag riding the wind very nicely.', '2003-02-15 09:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215845, 12236, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, great sense of perspective. The textures and colours here are cool. Some areas seem a little out of focus without meaning to be. A smaller aperture and longer shutter speed... etc (if you have that kind of control on your camera).</td>', 'Wow, great sense of perspective. The textures and colours here are cool. Some areas seem a little out of focus without meaning to be. A smaller aperture and longer shutter speed... etc (if you have that kind of control on your camera).', '2003-02-15 09:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(215847, 12200, 1037, '<td valign="top">OH! Gorgeous eucalypts. I wanna go to the rainforests!!! We have those beautiful Jarrah and Karri trees around here.<br/> <br/>The blue sky is very vivid against that silvery grey bark. Nicely done.</td>', 'OH! Gorgeous eucalypts. I wanna go to the rainforests!!! We have those beautiful Jarrah and Karri trees around here. The blue sky is very vivid against that silvery grey bark. Nicely done.', '2003-02-15 09:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215849, 12052, 1037, '<td valign="top">Weird. I can see how this fits the challenge. It''s an odd photo though. On an artistic level, it''s difficult to appreciate!</td>', 'Weird. I can see how this fits the challenge. It''s an odd photo though. On an artistic level, it''s difficult to appreciate!', '2003-02-15 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215854, 12118, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and serene. A little too busy for my taste, although the strong lines pull it all together well.</td>', 'Very pretty and serene. A little too busy for my taste, although the strong lines pull it all together well.', '2003-02-15 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(215856, 12270, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting shape and vivid colours. The photo is a little formal and symmetric to appeal to me though. Also, the part at the front with a lot of light on it seems to draw my eye, although it falls outside the range of your DOF. This is a little awkward compositionally.</td>', 'Interesting shape and vivid colours. The photo is a little formal and symmetric to appeal to me though. Also, the part at the front with a lot of light on it seems to draw my eye, although it falls outside the range of your DOF. This is a little awkward compositionally.', '2003-02-15 10:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(215866, 12129, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good and dramatic!</td>', 'Very good and dramatic!', '2003-02-15 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(215992, 12200, 1031, '<td valign="top">What I find most unusual is how the brances are so unevenly distributed around the trunks. Are there strong prevailing winds in this area?  Nice exposure, color, DOF.</td>', 'What I find most unusual is how the brances are so unevenly distributed around the trunks. Are there strong prevailing winds in this area?  Nice exposure, color, DOF.', '2003-02-15 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(215993, 12301, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very interesting formations -- never seen anything quite like it. Maybe some limestone formations.  Wish the branch in the lower-left foreground wasn''t there, but you integrated it into the rest well.</td>', 'Very interesting formations -- never seen anything quite like it. Maybe some limestone formations.  Wish the branch in the lower-left foreground wasn''t there, but you integrated it into the rest well.', '2003-02-15 12:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215994, 12143, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hope you''re not in "earthquake country."</td>', 'I hope you''re not in "earthquake country."', '2003-02-15 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215997, 12299, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job covering multiple interpretations with one image.</td>', 'Nice job covering multiple interpretations with one image.', '2003-02-15 13:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(216008, 12304, 5475, '<td valign="top">No doubt about it, that''s perspective!  Your focus, DOF, lighting is all great.  The depth of blue in the sky is really outstanding, and I like the clouds in the corner, although it would have been nicer if they were whiter to give more contrast.  Adjusting them to white would have blown elements in the tower, though.  I realize it''s against the rules for this contest, but it would be interesting to see this with more contrast in the details of the tower itself.  Maybe the burn tool in Photoshop (or similar method in another program) would bring out the details in the tower walls.  Nice job on this shot and good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'No doubt about it, that''s perspective!  Your focus, DOF, lighting is all great.  The depth of blue in the sky is really outstanding, and I like the clouds in the corner, although it would have been nicer if they were whiter to give more contrast.  Adjusting them to white would have blown elements in the tower, though.  I realize it''s against the rules for this contest, but it would be interesting to see this with more contrast in the details of the tower itself.  Maybe the burn tool in Photoshop (or similar method in another program) would bring out the details in the tower walls.  Nice job on this shot and good luck in the challenge!', '2003-02-15 15:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(216009, 12130, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like this perspective!  I have several similar shots of my children like this, and shooting them from above at a similar angle.  This shot would work better for me if I could see more face, and if there were more light on the face.  A reflector of some kind (whit foam board or even poster board works well) to the right would have cast more light to the right side of the face.  I love the depth of the blue in the sky and that it is a clear sky.  The sun on the edge of the frame breaks up the large area of blue and adds some interest.  I''m not usually a big fan of lens flare, but I think it works here.</td>', 'I like this perspective!  I have several similar shots of my children like this, and shooting them from above at a similar angle.  This shot would work better for me if I could see more face, and if there were more light on the face.  A reflector of some kind (whit foam board or even poster board works well) to the right would have cast more light to the right side of the face.  I love the depth of the blue in the sky and that it is a clear sky.  The sun on the edge of the frame breaks up the large area of blue and adds some interest.  I''m not usually a big fan of lens flare, but I think it works here.', '2003-02-15 15:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(216010, 12293, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m a big ''flag'' fan and I like this shot a lot.  Perspective is great, and the shape of the flag is excellent.  How many shots did you take to get this great composition?  I''ve shot 20-30 shots of flags in the past and wound up not liking any of them.  I like the way you can see both the front and the back of the flag due to the way it is waving.  The only thing I can think of to make this shot better would be to bring out the white of the stars in the flag.  Spot editing rules don''t allow it, but it would be fun to see this photo doctored up a bit in Photoshop.  Over all, an excellent copmosition, great perspective...  Good job!</td>', 'I''m a big ''flag'' fan and I like this shot a lot.  Perspective is great, and the shape of the flag is excellent.  How many shots did you take to get this great composition?  I''ve shot 20-30 shots of flags in the past and wound up not liking any of them.  I like the way you can see both the front and the back of the flag due to the way it is waving.  The only thing I can think of to make this shot better would be to bring out the white of the stars in the flag.  Spot editing rules don''t allow it, but it would be fun to see this photo doctored up a bit in Photoshop.  Over all, an excellent copmosition, great perspective...  Good job!', '2003-02-15 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(216011, 12285, 5475, '<td valign="top">Would have loved this shot with more DOF.  I like where the depth of field fades behind his head, but this would have been a powerful image if it were sharp all the way to the front of his head.  Still pretty amazing, though!</td>', 'Would have loved this shot with more DOF.  I like where the depth of field fades behind his head, but this would have been a powerful image if it were sharp all the way to the front of his head.  Still pretty amazing, though!', '2003-02-15 15:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(216012, 12236, 5475, '<td valign="top">Lots of character in this photo!  Great image, nice angle, definitely meets the perspective challenge.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Lots of character in this photo!  Great image, nice angle, definitely meets the perspective challenge.  Nicely done!', '2003-02-15 15:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(216013, 12299, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like your take on perspective and this is a great image.  I would have cropped it midway through the sand on the bottom.  I think this photo would have better balance with the horizon at the bottom third of the photo.  I don''t thinkyou would loose the expansive feel of the image with respect to the children, even corpped tighter on the bottom.</td>', 'I like your take on perspective and this is a great image.  I would have cropped it midway through the sand on the bottom.  I think this photo would have better balance with the horizon at the bottom third of the photo.  I don''t thinkyou would loose the expansive feel of the image with respect to the children, even corpped tighter on the bottom.', '2003-02-15 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(216014, 12307, 5475, '<td valign="top">Great image, but I''m not understanding your tie in to perspective.  I''m scoring this image based on how much I feel it ties into the challenge, although I feel it would deserve a better score just because it is such a good image.  If you can explain your tie in to perspective to me, I will adjust my score accordingly (if I understand and agree).  In order to stay anonamous and not violate any rules, you could create a free hotmail account or something like that so I won''t know who you are at DPChallenge!</td>', 'Great image, but I''m not understanding your tie in to perspective.  I''m scoring this image based on how much I feel it ties into the challenge, although I feel it would deserve a better score just because it is such a good image.  If you can explain your tie in to perspective to me, I will adjust my score accordingly (if I understand and agree).  In order to stay anonamous and not violate any rules, you could create a free hotmail account or something like that so I won''t know who you are at DPChallenge!', '2003-02-15 15:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(216015, 12159, 5475, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  composition, focus, lighting, DOF---all are perfect!  I''m giving it a 10!  One of my favorites (and only 10 so far) this week!</td>', 'What a great shot!  composition, focus, lighting, DOF---all are perfect!  I''m giving it a 10!  One of my favorites (and only 10 so far) this week!', '2003-02-15 15:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(216016, 12227, 5475, '<td valign="top">The Metro is a really great place for this challenge.  I didn''t even think of it (and I''m close by).  I like that you used black and white on this (the greenish yellow cast in the Metro shots would not have worked as well).   Nice angle, you did great with the lighting, which can be very difficult there.  The black rectangle in the upper left is a little distracting to me.  Overall a fun shot of a fun place!</td>', 'The Metro is a really great place for this challenge.  I didn''t even think of it (and I''m close by).  I like that you used black and white on this (the greenish yellow cast in the Metro shots would not have worked as well).   Nice angle, you did great with the lighting, which can be very difficult there.  The black rectangle in the upper left is a little distracting to me.  Overall a fun shot of a fun place!', '2003-02-15 15:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(216018, 12207, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice perspective!  I would have given it a 10 if you hadn''t cut of the leading edge of the ''e''</td>', 'Nice colors, nice perspective!  I would have given it a 10 if you hadn''t cut of the leading edge of the ''e''', '2003-02-15 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(216080, 12305, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is different...cute!  Good effect.</td>', 'This is different...cute!  Good effect.', '2003-02-15 20:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(216102, 12118, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-02-15 21:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(216105, 12146, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  From the thumbnail it looks like an eye of some sort.  Very nice!</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  From the thumbnail it looks like an eye of some sort.  Very nice!', '2003-02-15 21:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(216164, 12202, 6325, '<td valign="top">Enchanting. The white on white works well.  I wish the main house could have been kept upright (the engineer in me creeping out!).</td>', 'Enchanting. The white on white works well.  I wish the main house could have been kept upright (the engineer in me creeping out!).', '2003-02-16 00:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216165, 12304, 6325, '<td valign="top">This really captures the essence of the challenge. Great composure. The clouds give a good touch.</td>', 'This really captures the essence of the challenge. Great composure. The clouds give a good touch.', '2003-02-16 00:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(216166, 12178, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I want to see where this goes - really draws me in.</td>', 'Good shot. I want to see where this goes - really draws me in.', '2003-02-16 00:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(216168, 12200, 6325, '<td valign="top">Great color combinations. Captures the concept.</td>', 'Great color combinations. Captures the concept.', '2003-02-16 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(216169, 12302, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I don''t see perspective used. Maybe go around to the bottom of the hill and shoot up along the line of these magnificent structures? Get closer or use a long lense.</td>', 'Good shot, but I don''t see perspective used. Maybe go around to the bottom of the hill and shoot up along the line of these magnificent structures? Get closer or use a long lense.', '2003-02-16 00:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(216170, 12056, 6325, '<td valign="top">Takes some time, but this is a good subject. Maybe crop the top, it''s so busy and take so much of the space - takes long time to find the perspective lines.</td>', 'Takes some time, but this is a good subject. Maybe crop the top, it''s so busy and take so much of the space - takes long time to find the perspective lines.', '2003-02-16 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(216171, 12174, 6325, '<td valign="top">Moving - especially with the spectre of war upon us.  WIsh you could have gotten a lower angle.</td>', 'Moving - especially with the spectre of war upon us.  WIsh you could have gotten a lower angle.', '2003-02-16 00:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(216172, 12185, 6325, '<td valign="top">Wow. I thought it was jsut a pier and then as walked down it I found the Golden Gate Bridge! Did you try a crop cutting out Salsalito - making it more vertical?</td>', 'Wow. I thought it was jsut a pier and then as walked down it I found the Golden Gate Bridge! Did you try a crop cutting out Salsalito - making it more vertical?', '2003-02-16 01:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(216174, 12101, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Maybe the real perspective is the last student - "When you have to go, you have to go."</td>', 'Good shot. Maybe the real perspective is the last student - "When you have to go, you have to go."', '2003-02-16 01:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(216175, 12106, 6325, '<td valign="top">The angle is imaginative, but it doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'The angle is imaginative, but it doesn''t do it for me.', '2003-02-16 01:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(216176, 12141, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Tectures and shading work well. Maybe if the focus had been on the lower level, the top level would have been softened - the brightenss in the top level carries it.</td>', 'Good shot. Tectures and shading work well. Maybe if the focus had been on the lower level, the top level would have been softened - the brightenss in the top level carries it.', '2003-02-16 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(216178, 12132, 6325, '<td valign="top">Saki? I don''t travel to Japan anymore and I miss a good saki. This captures the spirit well.</td>', 'Saki? I don''t travel to Japan anymore and I miss a good saki. This captures the spirit well.', '2003-02-16 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216179, 12288, 6325, '<td valign="top">A little cluttered.</td>', 'A little cluttered.', '2003-02-16 01:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(216180, 12243, 6325, '<td valign="top">Like the color and the snow highlights. The angle seems unnecesary.</td>', 'Like the color and the snow highlights. The angle seems unnecesary.', '2003-02-16 01:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(216182, 12177, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good depth. A little more contrast would have helped - maybe convert to B&amp;W.</td>', 'Good depth. A little more contrast would have helped - maybe convert to B&W.', '2003-02-16 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(216184, 12109, 6325, '<td valign="top">The supreme bag lady - where is this?</td>', 'The supreme bag lady - where is this?', '2003-02-16 01:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(216185, 12143, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but it all washes together.</td>', 'Good subject, but it all washes together.', '2003-02-16 01:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(216187, 12185, 2110, '<td valign="top">May be a vertical format emphasizing the bridge, perhaps froma  little lower angle would have helped..</td>', 'May be a vertical format emphasizing the bridge, perhaps froma  little lower angle would have helped..', '2003-02-16 01:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(216188, 12204, 2110, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little more zoom in, to avoid so much extra blue space on the lower right corner woud have hleped. Also I would have preferred a little more breathing space on the top of the frame.</td>', 'Perhaps a little more zoom in, to avoid so much extra blue space on the lower right corner woud have hleped. Also I would have preferred a little more breathing space on the top of the frame.', '2003-02-16 01:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(216195, 12296, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good graphic feel to the image --strong colours and I like the unusual perspective-very strong</td>', 'Good graphic feel to the image --strong colours and I like the unusual perspective-very strong', '2003-02-16 05:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216196, 12282, 1019, '<td valign="top">Strong lines lead the eye up--one almost feels vertigo!--good colours -strong graphics this is symetrical without being boring using the staircase as a counterpoint</td>', 'Strong lines lead the eye up--one almost feels vertigo!--good colours -strong graphics this is symetrical without being boring using the staircase as a counterpoint', '2003-02-16 05:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(216198, 12118, 1019, '<td valign="top">A serene almost French feel to this--it really suits black and white although I wonder what de saturated colour would look like.</td>', 'A serene almost French feel to this--it really suits black and white although I wonder what de saturated colour would look like.', '2003-02-16 05:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(216199, 12299, 1019, '<td valign="top">I feel quite small when I see this--strong sky--good texture in the sand and a lovely overexposure coming from the right-the focus of attention is the children--well placed--a lovely composition.</td>', 'I feel quite small when I see this--strong sky--good texture in the sand and a lovely overexposure coming from the right-the focus of attention is the children--well placed--a lovely composition.', '2003-02-16 05:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(216200, 12141, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good perspective on the three levels--well exposed --good focus and well composed</td>', 'Good perspective on the three levels--well exposed --good focus and well composed', '2003-02-16 05:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(216201, 12253, 1019, '<td valign="top">Well composed--and good portrait even though you cant see the face properly.</td>', 'Well composed--and good portrait even though you cant see the face properly.', '2003-02-16 05:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(216202, 12271, 1019, '<td valign="top">Really excellent pet portrait--well done</td>', 'Really excellent pet portrait--well done', '2003-02-16 05:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(216203, 12206, 1019, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective and wonderful reflections</td>', 'Excellent perspective and wonderful reflections', '2003-02-16 05:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(216204, 12183, 1019, '<td valign="top">wonderful contrasts between the three levels--very good</td>', 'wonderful contrasts between the three levels--very good', '2003-02-16 05:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(216231, 12260, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I love all the textures. The overexposed look adds to the bleakness, so it works. That''s some real perspective there.</td>', 'This is really nice. I love all the textures. The overexposed look adds to the bleakness, so it works. That''s some real perspective there.', '2003-02-16 09:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(216233, 12139, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes and colours. It''s hard to know what I''m looking at. I''m not sure that the overxposed look of the sky works in this photo. It makes it seem glary.</td>', 'Interesting shapes and colours. It''s hard to know what I''m looking at. I''m not sure that the overxposed look of the sky works in this photo. It makes it seem glary.', '2003-02-16 09:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(216237, 12307, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really surreal and interesting. I love the shapes and colours. I guess it''s one of those Gallileo thermometers? I''m not sure that this meets the challenge in the sense of the description, but it''s a kind of perspective. Nice photo.</td>', 'This is really surreal and interesting. I love the shapes and colours. I guess it''s one of those Gallileo thermometers? I''m not sure that this meets the challenge in the sense of the description, but it''s a kind of perspective. Nice photo.', '2003-02-16 09:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(216239, 12280, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the number of branches here obscures the effect of the perspective. I can''t see the trunk tapering to the top of the treek, nor can I see many of the upper branches. This makes the photo a little flat.</td>', 'I think the number of branches here obscures the effect of the perspective. I can''t see the trunk tapering to the top of the treek, nor can I see many of the upper branches. This makes the photo a little flat.', '2003-02-16 09:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(216241, 12216, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool... but I don''t get a strong sense of perspective. There are bold lines running off into the distance, but they don''t converge an awful lot. The colours are a bit dull and nothing stands out as the compositional subject of the photo to pull my attention to it.</td>', 'Cool... but I don''t get a strong sense of perspective. There are bold lines running off into the distance, but they don''t converge an awful lot. The colours are a bit dull and nothing stands out as the compositional subject of the photo to pull my attention to it.', '2003-02-16 09:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(216243, 12271, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. The sense of perspective is spot on, the composition is perfect, the tones are rich. It''s great that this challenge inspired you to take such a unique photo of this dog :).</td>', 'This is really cool. The sense of perspective is spot on, the composition is perfect, the tones are rich. It''s great that this challenge inspired you to take such a unique photo of this dog :).', '2003-02-16 09:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(216244, 12227, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is neat and abstract. I like the black and white, grainy look. The strong lines are really effective.</td>', 'This is neat and abstract. I like the black and white, grainy look. The strong lines are really effective.', '2003-02-16 09:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216245, 12178, 1037, '<td valign="top">The perspective in this photo is effective, but it''s a bit centred and formal. There''s another railroad tracks shot like this that I''ve already rated, but it didn''t have those trees on either side and had more of a sense of distance. I think the trees here cut down on the impact of the ralroad tracks.</td>', 'The perspective in this photo is effective, but it''s a bit centred and formal. There''s another railroad tracks shot like this that I''ve already rated, but it didn''t have those trees on either side and had more of a sense of distance. I think the trees here cut down on the impact of the ralroad tracks.', '2003-02-16 10:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(216246, 12220, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that this really gives a strong sense of perspective. It''s a bit flat, and the reflected building seems to be the subject of the photo. I don''t feel that we see the reflected building at a steep angle. I like the photo though, I just don''t think it''s on topic.</td>', 'I''m not sure that this really gives a strong sense of perspective. It''s a bit flat, and the reflected building seems to be the subject of the photo. I don''t feel that we see the reflected building at a steep angle. I like the photo though, I just don''t think it''s on topic.', '2003-02-16 10:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(216247, 12069, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very, very cool photo. Handcuffs? I guess you took the angle of fooling us with a perspective trick (seeing one handcuff through the other) rather than the "dramatic" interpretation. The shallow DOF is used beautifully here, and the composition is great. 10 from me.</td>', 'This is a very, very cool photo. Handcuffs? I guess you took the angle of fooling us with a perspective trick (seeing one handcuff through the other) rather than the "dramatic" interpretation. The shallow DOF is used beautifully here, and the composition is great. 10 from me.', '2003-02-16 10:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(216248, 12106, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t have a lot of tonal depth, ie. overall it seems grey to me. The composition of the spindles is a bit too severely angled. It feels like it directs my eyes up to the top right corner, which isn''t a good feature compositionally.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t have a lot of tonal depth, ie. overall it seems grey to me. The composition of the spindles is a bit too severely angled. It feels like it directs my eyes up to the top right corner, which isn''t a good feature compositionally.', '2003-02-16 10:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(216249, 12214, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very dramatic. I love the colours. The shallow DOF is a good touch, directing my gaze to the 2nd... um... strut? But I think the subject matter is a little dull for all this. If the stair rail had more texture or some other feature of interest it may have worked better.</td>', 'This is very dramatic. I love the colours. The shallow DOF is a good touch, directing my gaze to the 2nd... um... strut? But I think the subject matter is a little dull for all this. If the stair rail had more texture or some other feature of interest it may have worked better.', '2003-02-16 10:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(216250, 12159, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very crisp. To me it''s kind of too crisp and sharp. There isn''t much feeling or artiistry to this photo. Very technically good with bright colours, and I''m sure a lot of people love it, but it leaves me cold.</td>', 'This is very crisp. To me it''s kind of too crisp and sharp. There isn''t much feeling or artiistry to this photo. Very technically good with bright colours, and I''m sure a lot of people love it, but it leaves me cold.', '2003-02-16 10:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(216251, 12126, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. IT''s so futuristic. The tonal depth is fantastic, and there''s a sense of movement and vibrancy. Very, very good. 10.</td>', 'I love this photo. IT''s so futuristic. The tonal depth is fantastic, and there''s a sense of movement and vibrancy. Very, very good. 10.', '2003-02-16 10:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(216252, 12310, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting effect, but to me it doesn''t make a very cool photo.  The cigarette is very far to the left of the photo for no apparent reason... the negative space doesn''t do much for the image.</td>', 'This is a very interesting effect, but to me it doesn''t make a very cool photo.  The cigarette is very far to the left of the photo for no apparent reason... the negative space doesn''t do much for the image.', '2003-02-16 10:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(216253, 12201, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting architecture, but the tones in the photo are a bit grey and dismal. It doesn''t highlight the textures or the details in the image.</td>', 'Very interesting architecture, but the tones in the photo are a bit grey and dismal. It doesn''t highlight the textures or the details in the image.', '2003-02-16 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(216254, 12174, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems a little too busy. A closer crop may have had a more dramatic effect.</td>', 'Seems a little too busy. A closer crop may have had a more dramatic effect.', '2003-02-16 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(216255, 12078, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great composition. This is a lovely nature photo. I spent some time in the southwest of the US last year and I love the landscape there.</td>', 'Great composition. This is a lovely nature photo. I spent some time in the southwest of the US last year and I love the landscape there.', '2003-02-16 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(216257, 12204, 1037, '<td valign="top">Oops, earlier I thought there were only 2 American-flag-up-a-pole photos, but there are 4!! As I''ve said on the other two I''ve rated, it''s hard for me to get over this symbolism, since I''m not American and I''m angry about the looming war. But this is a very strong photo. Of the 4, it''s in the top 2 :).</td>', 'Oops, earlier I thought there were only 2 American-flag-up-a-pole photos, but there are 4!! As I''ve said on the other two I''ve rated, it''s hard for me to get over this symbolism, since I''m not American and I''m angry about the looming war. But this is a very strong photo. Of the 4, it''s in the top 2 :).', '2003-02-16 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(216258, 12213, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea, but the composition is very loose and scattered. A tighter shot, or shallow DOF that brings strong focus to some area of the photo would strengthen it.</td>', 'I think this is a great idea, but the composition is very loose and scattered. A tighter shot, or shallow DOF that brings strong focus to some area of the photo would strengthen it.', '2003-02-16 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(216259, 12290, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice mix of colour with black and white. The composition is very strong. It''s pretty much technically perfect, but it''s one of those photos where I feel the technique is stronger than the subject choice. On an emotional level it leaves me a bit cold.</td>', 'Wow, very nice mix of colour with black and white. The composition is very strong. It''s pretty much technically perfect, but it''s one of those photos where I feel the technique is stronger than the subject choice. On an emotional level it leaves me a bit cold.', '2003-02-16 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(216260, 12188, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think that the wall is a little too marginalised in this photo. It doesn''t feel like it''s the subject, more an element that distracts a bit from the breathtaking landscape.</td>', 'I think that the wall is a little too marginalised in this photo. It doesn''t feel like it''s the subject, more an element that distracts a bit from the breathtaking landscape.', '2003-02-16 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(216264, 12183, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is cool. It''s fun to compare the different groups of people. Unfortunately, they''re all so small, I can''t really see their body languages as much as I''d like. A tighter crop maybe with just the top 2 levels might have been more effective (if it was possible, and the camera wasn''t low end).</td>', 'This is cool. It''s fun to compare the different groups of people. Unfortunately, they''re all so small, I can''t really see their body languages as much as I''d like. A tighter crop maybe with just the top 2 levels might have been more effective (if it was possible, and the camera wasn''t low end).', '2003-02-16 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(216270, 12060, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems like a very technically good image, but the subject isn''t interesting to me. It''s like something from a museum brochure, maybe. Dry and technical, but well done.</td>', 'Seems like a very technically good image, but the subject isn''t interesting to me. It''s like something from a museum brochure, maybe. Dry and technical, but well done.', '2003-02-16 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(216273, 12253, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is some kind of touristy statue, right? It''s a bit weird to look at. That''s not necessarily a bad thing :). It''s kind of funny, but the black and white treatment makes it feel like I''m supposed to take it very seriously. I think colour would be better for something kitsch like this.</td>', 'This is some kind of touristy statue, right? It''s a bit weird to look at. That''s not necessarily a bad thing :). It''s kind of funny, but the black and white treatment makes it feel like I''m supposed to take it very seriously. I think colour would be better for something kitsch like this.', '2003-02-16 10:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(216276, 12130, 1037, '<td valign="top">This composition is highly centred. In this case it kind of works. I like central composition when it has a purpose. However, I find this photo a little uniniteresting this way. All the negative space around the man is kind of purposeless. A closer crop would be more effective I think.<br/> <br/>I like the lens flare though, it really adds to the image :).</td>', 'This composition is highly centred. In this case it kind of works. I like central composition when it has a purpose. However, I find this photo a little uniniteresting this way. All the negative space around the man is kind of purposeless. A closer crop would be more effective I think. I like the lens flare though, it really adds to the image :).', '2003-02-16 10:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(216277, 12070, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s another dog photo in this challenge that shows how far you can go with perspective in a dog portrait. This one has its charm, but the front lighting flattens it and there isn''t quite enough nose to create a strong sense of perpective by itself!</td>', 'There''s another dog photo in this challenge that shows how far you can go with perspective in a dog portrait. This one has its charm, but the front lighting flattens it and there isn''t quite enough nose to create a strong sense of perpective by itself!', '2003-02-16 10:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(216278, 12301, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I''m not sure about the sense of perspective here. The shapes of the icicles are really weird and cool. The image seems tilted though.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I''m not sure about the sense of perspective here. The shapes of the icicles are really weird and cool. The image seems tilted though.', '2003-02-16 10:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(216279, 12202, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool and spooky. Odd how a house with so much whiteness to it can seem so "dark" in a moody way. The textures here are really interesting, and I love the hint of tree in the background.</td>', 'Cool and spooky. Odd how a house with so much whiteness to it can seem so "dark" in a moody way. The textures here are really interesting, and I love the hint of tree in the background.', '2003-02-16 10:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(216282, 12257, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very effective composition and great textures. Feels a little overexposed though. I don''t feel as though I''m seeing all the texture here as well as I could.</td>', 'Very effective composition and great textures. Feels a little overexposed though. I don''t feel as though I''m seeing all the texture here as well as I could.', '2003-02-16 11:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(216284, 12257, 3730, '<td valign="top">Great color, very nice perspective...a bit overexposed, IMO...still a nice shot. Good luck</td>', 'Great color, very nice perspective...a bit overexposed, IMO...still a nice shot. Good luck', '2003-02-16 11:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(216285, 12177, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great composition, and I feel like I see this tree in all its glory (some others in this challenge are a little too busy). The sky just seems a little overwhelming though. I think it''s a tad overexposed, so some of the twigs are disappearing. It supports the sense that this tree is barren, but it also makes the image a little glary and difficult to look at.</td>', 'Very nice. Great composition, and I feel like I see this tree in all its glory (some others in this challenge are a little too busy). The sky just seems a little overwhelming though. I think it''s a tad overexposed, so some of the twigs are disappearing. It supports the sense that this tree is barren, but it also makes the image a little glary and difficult to look at.', '2003-02-16 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(216286, 12287, 3730, '<td valign="top">I really like the creativity on this shot...the perspective is awesome, but I''m not too crazy about the purple sky. I would have uses a smaller aperture as well. Good luck :)</td>', 'I really like the creativity on this shot...the perspective is awesome, but I''m not too crazy about the purple sky. I would have uses a smaller aperture as well. Good luck :)', '2003-02-16 11:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
