(216288, 12260, 3730, '<td valign="top">One of my favs this week. The color is brilliant, and the perspective is awesome. I wish there was a bit of color in the sky. Great job nonetheless...good luck :)</td>', 'One of my favs this week. The color is brilliant, and the perspective is awesome. I wish there was a bit of color in the sky. Great job nonetheless...good luck :)', '2003-02-16 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
