(216293, 12240, 1037, '<td valign="top">What an amazing sculpture! I think you took a photo of it from a great angle, making good use of "other people''s art" to create an effective image. Great use of perspective and fantastic composition. If it was a cloudier day, perhaps the lighting would have been more in your favour, or perhaps you could have chosen dusk or dawn to take this photo.</td>', 'What an amazing sculpture! I think you took a photo of it from a great angle, making good use of "other people''s art" to create an effective image. Great use of perspective and fantastic composition. If it was a cloudier day, perhaps the lighting would have been more in your favour, or perhaps you could have chosen dusk or dawn to take this photo.', '2003-02-16 11:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(216294, 12230, 1037, '<td valign="top">I guess the perspective here is the cars vs. the train? Interesting idea. I think the photo is too busy though. A tighter crop might have helped, or taking it from a different angle so it isn''t so flat.</td>', 'I guess the perspective here is the cars vs. the train? Interesting idea. I think the photo is too busy though. A tighter crop might have helped, or taking it from a different angle so it isn''t so flat.', '2003-02-16 11:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
