(216522, 12299, 3018, '<td valign="top">I just love this picture!  It is one of my two favorites of the challenge.  B&amp;W is great. I also like the grain in the picture, it adds a feeling.  This is a beautiful shot by itself, but adding the two children is what won me.  Very beautiful.  Good luck in winning the challenge!</td>', 'I just love this picture!  It is one of my two favorites of the challenge.  B&W is great. I also like the grain in the picture, it adds a feeling.  This is a beautiful shot by itself, but adding the two children is what won me.  Very beautiful.  Good luck in winning the challenge!', '2003-02-16 22:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216523, 12299, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good choice on B&amp;W. Less sand and more universe would have been a better crop - IMO.</td>', 'Good choice on B&W. Less sand and more universe would have been a better crop - IMO.', '2003-02-16 22:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(216524, 12302, 3018, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Very rich colors.  The tilted horizon is great.  The cattle is what makes the picture for me, as it adds an element of uniqueness to your shot.  I know that for the challenge you''re not allowed to do spot-editing, but maybe for the future printing services at DPC, you could remove that pole that is standing next to the fourth windmill (left-to-right).  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is beautiful! Very rich colors.  The tilted horizon is great.  The cattle is what makes the picture for me, as it adds an element of uniqueness to your shot.  I know that for the challenge you''re not allowed to do spot-editing, but maybe for the future printing services at DPC, you could remove that pole that is standing next to the fourth windmill (left-to-right).  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-02-16 23:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(216527, 12263, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very nice face and "thinking" expression.  B&amp;W is great in this picture.  I''d crop a little bit more from the left.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice face and "thinking" expression.  B&W is great in this picture.  I''d crop a little bit more from the left.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-02-16 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
