(216773, 12271, 714, '<td valign="top">This is the coolest shot  I have seen on dpc.  Good job.  I can''t believe I beat you.  I thought for sure you would come in 1st.  You got a 10 from me.</td>', 'This is the coolest shot  I have seen on dpc.  Good job.  I can''t believe I beat you.  I thought for sure you would come in 1st.  You got a 10 from me.', '2003-02-17 01:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
