(217149, 12056, 715, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/>I hardly did any post-processing except lowering the saturation.<br/>And I only used the unsharp mask very slightly to get rid of the unsharpness caused by resizing.<br/> <br/>The scene looked like a skecth in reality, that''s called nature, not overprocessing :)<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments.I hardly did any post-processing except lowering the saturation.And I only used the unsharp mask very slightly to get rid of the unsharpness caused by resizing. The scene looked like a skecth in reality, that''s called nature, not overprocessing :)', '2003-02-17 08:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(217158, 12299, 772, '<td valign="top">Your shot, as usual, is quite outstanding... I enjoy searching yours out when the challenges are over... keep up the great work :)</td>', 'Your shot, as usual, is quite outstanding... I enjoy searching yours out when the challenges are over... keep up the great work :)', '2003-02-17 08:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
