(217381, 12301, 1005, '<td valign="top">Go figure!  Another shot I picked for high placement, due to it''s unusualness, but sorry, wrong again!  Nice pic!</td>', 'Go figure!  Another shot I picked for high placement, due to it''s unusualness, but sorry, wrong again!  Nice pic!', '2003-02-17 12:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
