(476309, 12185, 7687, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued by the way that the large blue area pushes my eyes to the left of the image.  From there I follow the pier into the center of the image only to find the Golden Gate bridge off in the distance.  I feel this image has some great composition and flow to it.  I really like how the presence of the GG Bridge is minimized, yet featured by the composition.  <br/> <br/>Excellent photo, 9 (if I were a voter).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-07 03:53:55.</i></td>', 'I''m intrigued by the way that the large blue area pushes my eyes to the left of the image.  From there I follow the pier into the center of the image only to find the Golden Gate bridge off in the distance.  I feel this image has some great composition and flow to it.  I really like how the presence of the GG Bridge is minimized, yet featured by the composition.   Excellent photo, 9 (if I were a voter).', '2003-11-07 03:51:37.000000', '2003-11-07 03:53:55.000000', 0),
